le word, <strong>\\u201cEh!\\u201d<\\/strong>, stayed with him. It represented something special about Canada: its friendly people, welcoming communities, and natural beauty.<\\/p><p>One day, while exploring Canada\'s beautiful wilderness, he discovered spring water that tasted exceptionally fresh, clean, and naturally smooth. He described that moment in a few simple words:<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#cbd5e1\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"76f5af7a\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.08)\",\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"4\",\"isLinked\":false},\"border_color\":\"#d4af37\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"12\",\"bottom\":\"12\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"18\",\"right\":\"24\",\"bottom\":\"18\",\"left\":\"24\",\"isLinked\":false},\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d24e7f78\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"\\u201cThis is what purity tastes like. This feels like home.\\u201d\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"title_color\":\"#ffd700\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Outfit\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20},\"typography_font_style\":\"italic\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"7d90ba44\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>That experience inspired a dream: to share the natural freshness of Canadian spring water with people around the world. Years later, our family decided to turn that dream into reality, with one clear mission: <strong>To bring premium Canadian spring water to the world while preserving its natural quality, purity, and character.<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#cbd5e1\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"91ddd0ae\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":44},\"width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6e9db140\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/stevencanadaehwater.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/causes_assets\\/canadian_road_journey.webp\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"align\":\"center\",\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"16\",\"right\":\"16\",\"bottom\":\"16\",\"left\":\"16\",\"isLinked\":true},\"box_shadow_box_shadow\":{\"horizontal\":0,\"vertical\":12,\"blur\":30,\"spread\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)\"},\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"image_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"16\",\"right\":\"16\",\"bottom\":\"16\",\"left\":\"16\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"a14845da\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"gradient\",\"background_color\":\"#0a1d3b\",\"background_color_b\":\"#051124\",\"background_gradient_angle\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":180},\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"1\",\"right\":\"1\",\"bottom\":\"1\",\"left\":\"1\",\"isLinked\":true},\"border_color\":\"rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3)\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"16\",\"right\":\"16\",\"bottom\":\"16\",\"left\":\"16\",\"isLinked\":true},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"24\",\"right\":\"24\",\"bottom\":\"24\",\"left\":\"24\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_align_items\":\"center\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1e07a115\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/stevencanadaehwater.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":110},\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"04f311a3\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"62257170\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"CANADA IN A BOTTLE\",\"header_size\":\"h5\",\"title_color\":\"#d4af37\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Outfit\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":13},\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":2}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"73209c8f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Pure Canadian Spring Water\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"title_color\":\"#ffffff\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Outfit\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20},\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"6\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"292bdd37\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Protected by Canadian government source lands, filtered naturally through mountain rock and ice.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#94a3b8\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Outfit\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14},\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6000000000000001}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"5c38e1ea\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#020712\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"90\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_align_items\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7e253421\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1240},\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_align_items\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e3b453a4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"CHAPTER TWO &bull; PROVEN STANDARDS\",\"header_size\":\"h5\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#d4af37\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=7044a64\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"04f914cf\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Quality Proven, Not Just Promised\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#ffffff\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"18\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=583e54c\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"e7bd409f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>A great story is important, but for us, a great story isn\'t enough. Quality must be proven, not just promised. Our quality is supported by rigorous international testing, official documentation, and an unwavering commitment to doing things properly.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"text_color\":\"#cbd5e1\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"40\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"5815cc1f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1240},\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_wrap\":\"wrap\",\"flex_justify_content\":\"space-between\",\"flex_align_items\":\"stretch\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a6c34f5d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":48.5},\"width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"background_background\":\"gradient\",\"background_color\":\"#0a1d3b\",\"background_color_b\":\"#051124\",\"background_gradient_angle\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":180},\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"1\",\"right\":\"1\",\"bottom\":\"1\",\"left\":\"1\",\"isLinked\":true},\"border_color\":\"rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3)\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"18\",\"right\":\"18\",\"bottom\":\"18\",\"left\":\"18\",\"isLinked\":true},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"24\",\"right\":\"24\",\"bottom\":\"28\",\"left\":\"24\",\"isLinked\":false},\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e874b120\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/stevencanadaehwater.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed.webp\",\"id\":1249,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"12\",\"right\":\"12\",\"bottom\":\"12\",\"left\":\"12\",\"isLinked\":true},\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"18\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":230,\"sizes\":[]},\"object-fit\":\"cover\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"8f32c944\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Dubai Government Laboratory Testing (2026)\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"title_color\":\"#ffffff\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Outfit\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":22},\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"12\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"20b019cb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"color\":\"rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.35)\",\"weight\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1},\"gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":8},\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"15\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"text\":\"Divider\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"7ec51893\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>In 2026, our Canadian spring water underwent laboratory testing in Dubai, United Arab Emirates, where it successfully passed the required tests.<\\/p><p>The results were documented in official reports issued by a Dubai government laboratory, and those records remain permanently on file as proof of our international standards.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#cbd5e1\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"626a765c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":48.5},\"width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"background_background\":\"gradient\",\"background_color\":\"#0a1d3b\",\"background_color_b\":\"#051124\",\"background_gradient_angle\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":180},\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"1\",\"right\":\"1\",\"bottom\":\"1\",\"left\":\"1\",\"isLinked\":true},\"border_color\":\"rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3)\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"18\",\"right\":\"18\",\"bottom\":\"18\",\"left\":\"18\",\"isLinked\":true},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"24\",\"right\":\"24\",\"bottom\":\"28\",\"left\":\"24\",\"isLinked\":false},\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"8849e919\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/stevencanadaehwater.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed.webp\",\"id\":1250,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"12\",\"right\":\"12\",\"bottom\":\"12\",\"left\":\"12\",\"isLinked\":true},\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"18\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":230,\"sizes\":[]},\"object-fit\":\"cover\",\"object-position\":\"top center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"b70b8502\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Canadian Testing & Naturally Occurring Minerals\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"title_color\":\"#ffffff\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Outfit\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":22},\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"12\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"d361caba\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"color\":\"rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.35)\",\"weight\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1},\"gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":8},\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"15\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"text\":\"Divider\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"2dcb14d1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Our water has passed applicable Canadian testing and regulatory requirements. We continue to test our water periodically as part of our commitment to maintaining consistent quality and safety.<\\/p><p>What makes Canada Eh! special is its natural mineral content: carefully bottled with as little human handling as possible, preserving the calcium, magnesium, and natural qualities that make it unique.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#cbd5e1\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"b3f28547\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#010610\",\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"1\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"border_color\":\"rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.25)\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"70\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_align_items\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b254c26c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1100},\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_align_items\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4aa46ea3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"CHAPTER THREE &bull; GLOBAL REACH\",\"header_size\":\"h5\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#d4af37\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=7044a64\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"cf7b7dcc\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"From Canada to the World\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#ffffff\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"22\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=583e54c\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"6fc571c6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Today, Canada Eh! is expanding its presence internationally, bringing premium Canadian spring water to businesses and homes in Dubai and across the UAE, Portugal, and other European markets.<\\/p><p>While our international journey continues to grow, we have taken a more gradual approach in Canada, our home market, focusing on building a strong foundation and lasting relationships.<\\/p><p>We believe that meaningful growth takes time. Our goal has never been simply to sell more bottles, but to build a Canadian brand that people can recognize, trust, and feel proud to support.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"text_color\":\"#cbd5e1\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Outfit\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16.5},\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.8500000000000001},\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"40\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"e08cb6ad\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"OUR CORE FAMILY VALUES\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#d4af37\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Outfit\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16},\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":3},\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"4bce6ce4\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1240},\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_wrap\":\"wrap\",\"flex_justify_content\":\"space-between\",\"flex_align_items\":\"stretch\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":