"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_align_items\":\"center\",\"flex_justify_content\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e76ee455\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"\\u201cTastes fresh, eh?\\u201d\",\"header_size\":\"span\",\"title_color\":\"#ffd700\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Outfit\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14.5},\"typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"align\":\"center\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"d5a04130\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>That simple word, <strong>\\u201cEh!\\u201d<\\/strong>, stayed with him. It represented something special about Canada: its friendly people, welcoming communities, and natural beauty.<\\/p><p>One day, while exploring Canada\'s beautiful wilderness, he discovered spring water that tasted exceptionally fresh, clean, and naturally smooth. He described that moment in a few simple words:<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#cbd5e1\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"76f5af7a\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.08)\",\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"4\",\"isLinked\":false},\"border_color\":\"#d4af37\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"12\",\"bottom\":\"12\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"18\",\"right\":\"24\",\"bottom\":\"18\",\"left\":\"24\",\"isLinked\":false},\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d24e7f78\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"\\u201cThis is what purity tastes like. This feels like home.\\u201d\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"title_color\":\"#ffd700\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Outfit\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20},\"typography_font_style\":\"italic\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"7d90ba44\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>That experience inspired a dream: to share the natural freshness of Canadian spring water with people around the world. Years later, our family decided to turn that dream into reality, with one clear mission: <strong>To bring premium Canadian spring water to the world while preserving its natural quality, purity, and character.<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#cbd5e1\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"91ddd0ae\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":44},\"width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6e9db140\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/stevencanadaehwater.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/causes_assets\\/canadian_road_journey.webp\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"align\":\"center\",\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"16\",\"right\":\"16\",\"bottom\":\"16\",\"left\":\"16\",\"isLinked\":true},\"box_shadow_box_shadow\":{\"horizontal\":0,\"vertical\