tiful wilderness, he discovered spring water that tasted exceptionally fresh, clean, and naturally smooth. He described that moment in a few simple words:<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#cbd5e1\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"76f5af7a\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.08)\",\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"4\",\"isLinked\":false},\"border_color\":\"#d4af37\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"12\",\"bottom\":\"12\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"18\",\"right\":\"24\",\"bottom\":\"18\",\"left\":\"24\",\"isLinked\":false},\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d24e7f78\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"\\u201cThis is what purity tastes like. This feels like home.\\u201d\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"title_color\":\"#ffd700\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Outfit\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20},\"typography_font_style\":\"italic\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"7d90ba44\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>That experience inspired a dream: to share the natural freshness of Canadian spring water with people around the world. Years later, our family decided to turn that dream into reality, with one clear mission: <strong>To bring premium Canadian spring water to the world while preserving its natural quality, purity, and character.<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#cbd5e1\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"91ddd0ae\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":44},\"width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6e9db140\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/stevencanadaehwater.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/causes_assets\\/canadian_road_journey.webp\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"align\":\"center\",\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"16\",\"right\":\"16\",\"bottom\":\"16\",\"left\":\"16\",\"isLinked\":true},\"box_shadow_box_shadow\":{\"horizontal\":0,\"vertical\":12,\"blur\":30,\"spread\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)\"},\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"image_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"16\",\"right\":\"16\",\"bottom\":\"16\",\"left\":\"16\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"a14845da\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"gradient\",\"background_color\":\"#0a1d3b\",\"background_color_b\":\"#051124\",\"background_gradient_angle\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":180},\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"1\",\"right\":\"1\",\"bottom\":\"1\",\"left\":\"1\",\"isLinked\":true},\"border_color\":\"rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3)\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"16\",\"right\":\"16\",\"bottom\":\"16\",\"left\":\"16\",\"isLinked\":true},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"24\",\"right\":\"24\",\"bottom\":\"24\",\"left\":\"24\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_align_items\":\"center\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1e07a115\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/stevencanadaehwater.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":110},\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"04f311a3\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"62257170\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"CANADA IN A BOTTLE\",\"header_size\":\"h5\",\"title_color\":\"#d4af37\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Outfit\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":13},\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":2}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"73209c8f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Pure Canadian Spring Water\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"title_color\":\"#ffffff\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Outfit\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20},\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"6\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"292bdd37\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Protected by Canadian government source lands, filtered naturally through mountain rock and ice.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#94a3b8\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Outfit\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14},\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6000000000000001}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"5c38e1ea\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"backgr