INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1,1,'2025-12-07 17:20:45','2025-12-07 17:20:45','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to WordPress. This is your first post. Edit or delete it, then start writing!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Hello world!','','publish','open','open','','hello-world','','','2025-12-07 17:20:45','2025-12-07 17:20:45','',0,'https://canadaehwater.com/?p=1',0,'post','',1),(2,1,'2025-12-07 17:20:45','2025-12-07 17:20:45','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is an example page. It\'s different from a blog post because it will stay in one place and will show up in your site navigation (in most themes). Most people start with an About page that introduces them to potential site visitors. It might say something like this:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hi there! I\'m a bike messenger by day, aspiring actor by night, and this is my website. I live in Los Angeles, have a great dog named Jack, and I like pi&#241;a coladas. (And gettin\' caught in the rain.)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>...or something like this:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The XYZ Doohickey Company was founded in 1971, and has been providing quality doohickeys to the public ever since. Located in Gotham City, XYZ employs over 2,000 people and does all kinds of awesome things for the Gotham community.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a new WordPress user, you should go to <a href=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-admin/\">your dashboard</a> to delete this page and create new pages for your content. Have fun!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Sample Page','','publish','closed','open','','sample-page','','','2025-12-07 17:20:45','2025-12-07 17:20:45','',0,'https://canadaehwater.com/?page_id=2',0,'page','',0),(3,1,'2025-12-07 17:20:45','2025-12-07 17:20:45','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we are</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Our website address is: http://stevencanadaehwater.local.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Comments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, and also the visitor&#8217;s IP address and browser user agent string to help spam detection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An anonymized string created from your email address (also called a hash) may be provided to the Gravatar service to see if you are using it. The Gravatar service privacy policy is available here: https://automattic.com/privacy/. After approval of your comment, your profile picture is visible to the public in the context of your comment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Media</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you upload images to the website, you should avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS) included. Visitors to the website can download and extract any location data from images on the website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cookies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment on our site you may opt-in to saving your name, email address and website in cookies. These are for your convenience so that you do not have to fill in your details again when you leave another comment. These cookies will last for one year.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you visit our login page, we will set a temporary cookie to determine if your browser accepts cookies. This cookie contains no personal data and is discarded when you close your browser.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you log in, we will also set up several cookies to save your login information and your screen display choices. Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you select &quot;Remember Me&quot;, your login will persist for two weeks. If you log out of your account, the login cookies will be removed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you edit or publish an article, an additional cookie will be saved in your browser. This cookie includes no personal data and simply indicates the post ID of the article you just edited. It expires after 1 day.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Embedded content from other websites</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we share your data with</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long we retain your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For users that register on our website (if any), we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). Website administrators can also see and edit that information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What rights you have over your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where your data is sent</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n','Privacy Policy','','draft','closed','open','','privacy-policy','','','2025-12-07 17:20:45','2025-12-07 17:20:45','',0,'https://canadaehwater.com/?page_id=3',0,'page','',0),(4,0,'2025-12-07 17:20:45','2025-12-07 17:20:45','<!-- wp:page-list /-->','Navigation','','publish','closed','closed','','navigation','','','2025-12-07 17:20:45','2025-12-07 17:20:45','',0,'https://canadaehwater.com/2025/12/07/navigation/',0,'wp_navigation','',0),(6,1,'2025-12-07 17:22:11','2025-12-07 17:22:11','<h1>Untouched\nMagical Water\nFrom Canada</h1>		<p>Born in the Protected Springs of Canada</p>								<a href=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/our-story/\">\n									About us\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"887\" height=\"1774\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png 887w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1-150x300.png 150w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1-512x1024.png 512w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1-768x1536.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 887px) 100vw, 887px\" />																		\n			Your digestion calms.			\n				0\n				%\n			Your system unclogs.			\n				0\n				%\n			 Your energy rises.			\n				0\n				%\n			Your skin looks fresher.			\n				0\n				%\n							<h3>بلدية دبي </br>\nDubai Municipality</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M446.7 98.6l-67.6 318.8c-5.1 22.5-18.4 28.1-37.3 17.5l-103-75.9-49.7 47.8c-5.5 5.5-10.1 10.1-20.7 10.1l7.4-104.9 190.9-172.5c8.3-7.4-1.8-11.5-12.9-4.1L117.8 284 16.2 252.2c-22.1-6.9-22.5-22.1 4.6-32.7L418.2 66.4c18.4-6.9 34.5 4.1 28.5 32.2z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>TESTED &amp; PASSED BY DUBAI MUNICIPALITY</h3>							\n												<a href=\"#\">\n									SOLD IN THE UAE AS A PREMIUM WATER\n					</a>\n									<h3>CANADIAN SPRING SOURCE TESTED</h3>															<img width=\"48\" height=\"36\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gg-flag-canada.png\" alt=\"\" />																<h3>(Based on the attached\nlab reports)</h3>							\n							<h3>FROM RAIN &amp; MELTED SNOW</h3>		<p style=\"margin: 0; text-align: center;\">A natural blend of Canada\'s pristine rain and snowmelt that feeds our protected spring source.</p>			<h3>PURE MOUNTAIN SPRING WATER</h3>		<p style=\"margin: 0; text-align: center;\">Naturally filtered as it flows through ancient rock layers, carrying essential minerals to your home.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M383.8 351.7c2.5-2.5 105.2-92.4 105.2-92.4l-17.5-7.5c-10-4.9-7.4-11.5-5-17.4 2.4-7.6 20.1-67.3 20.1-67.3s-47.7 10-57.7 12.5c-7.5 2.4-10-2.5-12.5-7.5s-15-32.4-15-32.4-52.6 59.9-55.1 62.3c-10 7.5-20.1 0-17.6-10 0-10 27.6-129.6 27.6-129.6s-30.1 17.4-40.1 22.4c-7.5 5-12.6 5-17.6-5C293.5 72.3 255.9 0 255.9 0s-37.5 72.3-42.5 79.8c-5 10-10 10-17.6 5-10-5-40.1-22.4-40.1-22.4S183.3 182 183.3 192c2.5 10-7.5 17.5-17.6 10-2.5-2.5-55.1-62.3-55.1-62.3S98.1 167 95.6 172s-5 9.9-12.5 7.5C73 177 25.4 167 25.4 167s17.6 59.7 20.1 67.3c2.4 6 5 12.5-5 17.4L23 259.3s102.6 89.9 105.2 92.4c5.1 5 10 7.5 5.1 22.5-5.1 15-10.1 35.1-10.1 35.1s95.2-20.1 105.3-22.6c8.7-.9 18.3 2.5 18.3 12.5S241 512 241 512h30s-5.8-102.7-5.8-112.8 9.5-13.4 18.4-12.5c10 2.5 105.2 22.6 105.2 22.6s-5-20.1-10-35.1 0-17.5 5-22.5z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>BOTTLED IN CANADA</h3>		Under strict Canadian hygiene and quality standards.					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M466.5 83.7l-192-80a48.15 48.15 0 0 0-36.9 0l-192 80C27.7 91.1 16 108.6 16 128c0 198.5 114.5 335.7 221.5 380.3 11.8 4.9 25.1 4.9 36.9 0C360.1 472.6 496 349.3 496 128c0-19.4-11.7-36.9-29.5-44.3zM256.1 446.3l-.1-381 175.9 73.3c-3.3 151.4-82.1 261.1-175.8 307.7z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>ONGOING WATER TESTING</h3>		<p style=\"margin: 0; text-align: center;\">We test our water regularly to keep our quality and promises.</p>					\n							<h3>NATURAL MINERALS</h3>		Contains naturally occurring minerals like Calcium and Magnesium.													<img width=\"1774\" height=\"887\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/01-canada-eh-water-delivery-van.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/01-canada-eh-water-delivery-van.webp 1774w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/01-canada-eh-water-delivery-van-300x150.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/01-canada-eh-water-delivery-van-1024x512.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/01-canada-eh-water-delivery-van-768x384.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/01-canada-eh-water-delivery-van-1536x768.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1774px) 100vw, 1774px\" />																		\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M148 288h-40c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-40c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v40c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12zm108-12v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm96 0v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm-96 96v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm-96 0v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm192 0v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm96-260v352c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H48c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V112c0-26.5 21.5-48 48-48h48V12c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v52h128V12c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v52h48c26.5 0 48 21.5 48 48zm-48 346V160H48v298c0 3.3 2.7 6 6 6h340c3.3 0 6-2.7 6-6z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>SUBSCRIPTION PLANS\n</h3>		<p>Monthly or biweekly delivery<br />right to your door.</p>													<img width=\"1400\" height=\"784\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02-canada-eh-water-home-delivery.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02-canada-eh-water-home-delivery.webp 1400w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02-canada-eh-water-home-delivery-300x168.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02-canada-eh-water-home-delivery-1024x573.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02-canada-eh-water-home-delivery-768x430.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1400px) 100vw, 1400px\" />																		\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M148 288h-40c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-40c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v40c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12zm108-12v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm96 0v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm-96 96v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm-96 0v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm192 0v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm96-260v352c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H48c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V112c0-26.5 21.5-48 48-48h48V12c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v52h128V12c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v52h48c26.5 0 48 21.5 48 48zm-48 346V160H48v298c0 3.3 2.7 6 6 6h340c3.3 0 6-2.7 6-6z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>SUPPORT FOR SENIORS</h3>		<p>A convenient delivery service for the elderly, with reliable and friendly support.</p>													<img width=\"1774\" height=\"887\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03-canada-eh-water-school.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03-canada-eh-water-school.webp 1774w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03-canada-eh-water-school-300x150.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03-canada-eh-water-school-1024x512.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03-canada-eh-water-school-768x384.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03-canada-eh-water-school-1536x768.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1774px) 100vw, 1774px\" />																		\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M148 288h-40c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-40c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v40c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12zm108-12v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm96 0v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm-96 96v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm-96 0v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm192 0v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm96-260v352c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H48c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V112c0-26.5 21.5-48 48-48h48V12c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v52h128V12c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v52h48c26.5 0 48 21.5 48 48zm-48 346V160H48v298c0 3.3 2.7 6 6 6h340c3.3 0 6-2.7 6-6z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>SCHOOLS WELCOME</h3>		<p>Smaller bottle sizes, perfect for schools, kids and daily hydration.</p>			<h2>OUR COMMUNITY COMMITMENT</h2>		<p style=\"margin: 0; text-align: center;\">Giving back to Canada: people, communities, and a brighter future.</p>													<img width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/veteran_saluting_the_canadian_flag_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/veteran_saluting_the_canadian_flag_compressed.webp 1672w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/veteran_saluting_the_canadian_flag_compressed-300x169.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/veteran_saluting_the_canadian_flag_compressed-1024x576.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/veteran_saluting_the_canadian_flag_compressed-768x432.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/veteran_saluting_the_canadian_flag_compressed-1536x864.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1672px) 100vw, 1672px\" />																		\n							<h3>SUPPORTING CANADIAN VETERANS</h3>															<img width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/warmth_shared_a_grateful_meal_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/warmth_shared_a_grateful_meal_compressed.webp 1672w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/warmth_shared_a_grateful_meal_compressed-300x169.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/warmth_shared_a_grateful_meal_compressed-1024x576.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/warmth_shared_a_grateful_meal_compressed-768x432.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/warmth_shared_a_grateful_meal_compressed-1536x864.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1672px) 100vw, 1672px\" />																		\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M280.37 148.26L96 300.11V464a16 16 0 0 0 16 16l112.06-.29a16 16 0 0 0 15.92-16V368a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h64a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v95.64a16 16 0 0 0 16 16.05L464 480a16 16 0 0 0 16-16V300L295.67 148.26a12.19 12.19 0 0 0-15.3 0zM571.6 251.47L488 182.56V44.05a12 12 0 0 0-12-12h-56a12 12 0 0 0-12 12v72.61L318.47 43a48 48 0 0 0-61 0L4.34 251.47a12 12 0 0 0-1.6 16.9l25.5 31A12 12 0 0 0 45.15 301l235.22-193.74a12.19 12.19 0 0 1 15.3 0L530.9 301a12 12 0 0 0 16.9-1.6l25.5-31a12 12 0 0 0-1.7-16.93z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>HELPING PEOPLE EXPERIENCING HOMELESSNESS</h3>															<img width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/beaded_regalia_against_mountain_sunset_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/beaded_regalia_against_mountain_sunset_compressed.webp 1672w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/beaded_regalia_against_mountain_sunset_compressed-300x169.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/beaded_regalia_against_mountain_sunset_compressed-1024x576.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/beaded_regalia_against_mountain_sunset_compressed-768x432.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/beaded_regalia_against_mountain_sunset_compressed-1536x864.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1672px) 100vw, 1672px\" />																		\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M148 288h-40c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-40c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v40c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12zm108-12v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm96 0v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm-96 96v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm-96 0v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm192 0v-40c0-6.6-5.4-12-12-12h-40c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v40c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12h40c6.6 0 12-5.4 12-12zm96-260v352c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H48c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V112c0-26.5 21.5-48 48-48h48V12c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v52h128V12c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h40c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v52h48c26.5 0 48 21.5 48 48zm-48 346V160H48v298c0 3.3 2.7 6 6 6h340c3.3 0 6-2.7 6-6z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>SUPPORTING INDIGENOUS COMMUNITIES</h3>','HOME','','publish','closed','closed','','home','','','2026-11-25 05:28:15','2026-11-25 05:28:15','',0,'https://canadaehwater.com/?page_id=6',0,'page','',0),(7,1,'2025-12-07 17:21:42','2025-12-07 17:21:42','{\"version\": 3, \"isGlobalStylesUserThemeJSON\": true }','Custom Styles','','publish','closed','closed','','wp-global-styles-twentytwentyfive','','','2025-12-07 17:21:42','2025-12-07 17:21:42','',0,'https://canadaehwater.com/2025/12/07/wp-global-styles-twentytwentyfive/',0,'wp_global_styles','',0),(9,1,'2025-12-07 17:22:25','2025-12-07 17:22:25','<h4>CANADIAN VALUES &bull; GLOBAL IMPACT</h4>					<h1>Canadian Values. Global Impact.</h1>							\n				<p>At Canada Eh!, we believe in supporting every country where our water is sold, the Canadian way — with kindness, generosity, and care for others.</p><p>Every country has different needs, and we want to make a positive difference in each one.</p><p>Every year, we give back through trusted organizations and proper channels. As our company grows, our support will grow too, helping more people, families, and communities around the world.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/canada_cause.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Canada_Pantone.svg.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h4>Canada (CA)</h4>					<h3>Supporting Our Own Communities</h3>							\n				Canada is our home, and giving back starts here. Every year, we aim to support: Veterans who have served our country; Low-income families struggling with everyday expenses; People experiencing homelessness who need food, shelter, and support; Indigenous Canadians and communities through programs that improve lives and create opportunities.													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/portugal_cause.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Portugal_official.svg.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h4>Portugal (PT)</h4>					<h3>Helping Families and Communities</h3>							\n				<p>We support families in need through food programs, basic necessities, and local community projects. We also help protect Portugal\'s beautiful environment.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/monaco_cause.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Monaco-flag.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h4>Monaco (MC)</h4>					<h3>Protecting the Ocean</h3>							\n				<p>We support projects that keep beaches clean, reduce pollution, and protect marine animals and the Mediterranean Sea.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/luxembourg_cause.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Luxembourg-Flag.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h4>Luxembourg (LU)</h4>					<h3>Supporting Children and Nature</h3>							\n				<p>We help support children\'s health and environmental projects that protect forests and create a healthier future.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/singapore_cause.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Singapore-1.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h4>Singapore (SG)</h4>					<h3>Creating Opportunities for Young People</h3>							\n				<p>We support education, training, and programs that help young people develop skills and build better futures.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/dubai_cause.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_the_United_Arab_Emirates.svg.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h4>Dubai (AE)</h4>					<h3>Protecting Beaches and Marine Life</h3>							\n				<p>We support beach cleanups, ocean protection, and projects that reduce plastic waste and keep the Gulf cleaner.</p>			<h4>OUR PROMISE</h4>					<h2>Our Promise — Growing Together, Giving Back Together</h2>							\n				<p>Wherever Canada Eh! is sold, we want to give something back to that country.</p><p>Our goal is simple: Support local communities, respect each country\'s needs, and share the Canadian spirit of kindness around the world. We plan to make contributions annually through trusted organizations and proper channels, with our support expanding as our business grows.</p><p>The more bottles we sell, the more people and communities we can help.</p>			<h4>Canada Eh! — Every Sip Refreshes You. Every Drop Makes a Difference.</h4>','Each Drop Matters','','publish','closed','closed','','each-drop-matters','','','2026-11-25 04:29:17','2026-11-25 04:29:17','',0,'https://canadaehwater.com/?page_id=9',0,'page','',0),(11,1,'2025-12-07 17:22:39','2025-12-07 17:22:39','<h4>AUTHENTIC CANADIAN HERITAGE</h4>					<h1>Born From Our Family, Born From the Land</h1>							\n				<p>A proudly Canadian brand inspired by our family\'s story, Canada\'s natural beauty, and the genuine kindness of its people.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER ONE &bull; THE 1990s</h5>					<h2>A Simple Word That Stayed With Us</h2>		<p>Our story began in the 1990s, when our father frequently traveled between Canada and the United States for business.</p><p>During his travels, he visited a few small Canadian towns, driving through beautiful forests, quiet country roads, and peaceful communities where people welcomed him with warm smiles and a familiar Canadian expression:</p>			“Beautiful day, eh?”					“Good water, eh?”					“Tastes fresh, eh?”		<p>That simple word, <strong>“Eh!”</strong>, stayed with him. It represented something special about Canada: its friendly people, welcoming communities, and natural beauty.</p><p>One day, while exploring Canada\'s beautiful wilderness, he discovered spring water that tasted exceptionally fresh, clean, and naturally smooth. He described that moment in a few simple words:</p>			<h4>“This is what purity tastes like. This feels like home.”</h4>		<p>That experience inspired a dream: to share the natural freshness of Canadian spring water with people around the world. Years later, our family decided to turn that dream into reality, with one clear mission: <strong>To bring premium Canadian spring water to the world while preserving its natural quality, purity, and character.</strong></p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/canadian_road_journey.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h5>CANADA IN A BOTTLE</h5>					<h3>Pure Canadian Spring Water</h3>		<p>Protected by Canadian government source lands, filtered naturally through mountain rock and ice.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER TWO &bull; PROVEN STANDARDS</h5>					<h2>Quality Proven, Not Just Promised</h2>		<p>A great story is important, but for us, a great story isn\'t enough. Quality must be proven, not just promised. Our quality is supported by rigorous international testing, official documentation, and an unwavering commitment to doing things properly.</p>													<img width=\"1916\" height=\"821\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed.webp 1916w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-300x129.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-1024x439.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-768x329.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-1536x658.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1916px) 100vw, 1916px\" />																<h3>Dubai Government Laboratory Testing (2026)</h3>							\n				<p>In 2026, our Canadian spring water underwent laboratory testing in Dubai, United Arab Emirates, where it successfully passed the required tests.</p><p>The results were documented in official reports issued by a Dubai government laboratory, and those records remain permanently on file as proof of our international standards.</p>													<img width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed.webp 1672w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-300x169.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-1024x576.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-768x432.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-1536x864.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1672px) 100vw, 1672px\" />																<h3>Canadian Testing &amp; Naturally Occurring Minerals</h3>							\n				<p>Our water has passed applicable Canadian testing and regulatory requirements. We continue to test our water periodically as part of our commitment to maintaining consistent quality and safety.</p><p>What makes Canada Eh! special is its natural mineral content: carefully bottled with as little human handling as possible, preserving the calcium, magnesium, and natural qualities that make it unique.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER THREE &bull; GLOBAL REACH</h5>					<h2>From Canada to the World</h2>		<p>Today, Canada Eh! is expanding its presence internationally, bringing premium Canadian spring water to businesses and homes in Dubai and across the UAE, Portugal, and other European markets.</p><p>While our international journey continues to grow, we have taken a more gradual approach in Canada, our home market, focusing on building a strong foundation and lasting relationships.</p><p>We believe that meaningful growth takes time. Our goal has never been simply to sell more bottles, but to build a Canadian brand that people can recognize, trust, and feel proud to support.</p>			<h4>OUR CORE FAMILY VALUES</h4>					<h6>01</h6>					<h4>Purity</h4>		<p>Natural spring water from government-protected Canadian lands, preserved without artificial processing.</p>			<h6>02</h6>					<h4>Respect</h4>		<p>Deep respect for the land, our home communities, and every country where our bottles are sold.</p>			<h6>03</h6>					<h4>Honesty</h4>		<p>Transparency in all we do, backed by verified laboratory documentation and rigorous standards.</p>			<h6>04</h6>					<h4>Quality</h4>		<p>Carefully bottled with minimal human contact, preserving balanced natural calcium and magnesium.</p>			<h6>05</h6>					<h4>And a touch of “Eh!”</h4>		<p>The genuine warmth, hospitality, and welcoming kindness of the Canadian spirit in every single drop.</p>			<h4>“No matter how far our water travels, our roots will always remain Canadian.”</h4>					<h5>A Taste of Home in Every Bottle &bull; “It’s Canada in a bottle.”</h5>','Our Story','','publish','closed','closed','','our-story','','','2026-11-24 12:12:54','2026-11-24 12:12:54','',0,'https://canadaehwater.com/?page_id=11',0,'page','',0),(13,1,'2025-12-07 17:22:51','2025-12-07 17:22:51','AUTHENTIC CANADIAN HERITAGE					<h1>Every Drop Reflects the Purity and Beauty of Nature</h1>		<p>Water as nature intended. Naturally occurring minerals, a refreshingly clean taste, and a beautifully balanced character. Canada EH! celebrates the simplicity of water, bringing an exceptional drinking experience to your everyday moments. No unnecessary promises. Just nature, quality, and authentic refreshment.</p>			THE SIGNATURE CHARACTER					<h2>Experience the Difference</h2>		<p>Each bottle of Canada EH! Water represents nature\'s highest standard of purity, refreshing clarity, and balanced hydration.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Naturally occurring mineral composition</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Crisp, clean and refreshing taste</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Smooth and balanced drinking experience</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Inspired by Canada\'s remarkable natural heritage</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Refreshment for every occasion</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>A premium addition to your everyday lifestyle</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>An appreciation for nature and simplicity</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Exceptional quality in every bottle</h3>															<img width=\"887\" height=\"1774\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png 887w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1-150x300.png 150w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1-512x1024.png 512w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1-768x1536.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 887px) 100vw, 887px\" />																CANADA EH! WATER					<h3>Pure Canadian Spring Water</h3>		<p>Harvested from protected Canadian spring zones. Pure, balanced, and bottled fresh at source.</p>			ELEVATE YOUR EVERYDAY HYDRATION					<h2>Experience Authentic Canadian Refreshment</h2>		<p>Discover our collection of premium Canadian spring water bottles, crafted for mindful living and refined taste.</p>								<a href=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/products/\">\n									Explore Our Collection\n					</a>','Why It’s Magical Water','','publish','closed','closed','','why-its-magical-water','','','2026-11-25 05:06:07','2026-11-25 05:06:07','',0,'https://canadaehwater.com/?page_id=13',0,'page','',0),(1407,1,'2026-11-25 04:40:11','2026-11-25 04:40:11','AUTHENTIC CANADIAN HERITAGE					<h1>Every Drop Reflects the Purity and Beauty of Nature</h1>		<p>Water as nature intended. Naturally occurring minerals, a refreshingly clean taste, and a beautifully balanced character. Canada EH! celebrates the simplicity of water, bringing an exceptional drinking experience to your everyday moments. No unnecessary promises. Just nature, quality, and authentic refreshment.</p>			THE SIGNATURE CHARACTER					<h2>Experience the Difference</h2>		<p>Each bottle of Canada EH! Water represents nature\'s highest standard of purity, refreshing clarity, and balanced hydration.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Naturally occurring mineral composition</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Crisp, clean and refreshing taste</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Smooth and balanced drinking experience</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.