://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.43_PM__2_-removebg-preview-1.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>FLAGSHIP BOTTLE</h6>					<h3>Signature 1 Litre</h3>					<h5>1000 ML (1 LITRE)</h5>		<p>Our flagship size for full-day hydration, active routines, and dining tables. Perfectly balanced natural electrolytes in food-grade RPET.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.43_PM__1_-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>PREMIUM TABLE SIZE</h6>					<h3>Signature 750 ML</h3>					<h5>750 ML</h5>		<p>Sleek and tall presentation. Engineered for executive desks, restaurants, and hospitality with crystal clarity and smooth taste.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.43_PM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>DAILY ON-THE-GO</h6>					<h3>Signature 500 ML</h3>					<h5>500 ML</h5>		<p>The classic everyday bottle. Lightweight, ergonomic grip, and perfect for carrying in bags, cars, and gym sessions.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_9.09.27_AM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>LUXURY HOSPITALITY</h6>					<h3>Diamond Embossed</h3>					<h5>500 ML</h5>		<p>Distinctive diamond-patterned bottle reflecting light like Canadian glacial ice. Designed for hotels, VIP venues, and fine dining.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.44_PM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>COMPACT SIZE</h6>					<h3>Signature 296 ML</h3>					<h5>296 ML</h5>		<p>Convenient smaller format for quick hydration, conference tables, and on-the-move refreshment without excess weight.</p>			<h5>SUSTAINABLE ALUMINUM &amp; SPECIAL EDITIONS</h5>					<h2>Cans &amp; Designer Editions</h2>							\n																	<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.44_PM__1_-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>SIGNATURE EDITION</h6>					<h3>Snowflake Gold Can</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Sleek gold recyclable aluminum can containing pure non-carbonated spring water. Chills rapidly and stays crisp longer.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_9.09.04_AM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>GLACIAL EDITION</h6>					<h3>Snowflake White Can</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Clean alpine white aluminum can featuring our Canadian maple snowflake motif. Light, recyclable, and infinitely sustainable.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-05_at_1.24.47_PM-removebg-preview.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>WELLNESS &amp; BEAUTY</h6>					<h3>Women’s Edition</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Blush pink designer can paired with our silky, skin-hydrating natural spring water. Tailored for spas, boutiques, and wellness centers.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-05_at_1.24.47_PM__1_-removebg-preview.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>EXECUTIVE &amp; PERFORMANCE</h6>					<h3>Men’s Edition</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Matte black aluminum can with gold accents. Bold presentation for gyms, boardroom meetings, and performance recovery.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-06_at_11.43.50_AM-removebg-preview.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>FOR LITTLE ONES</h6>					<h3>Kids Edition</h3>					<h5>296 ML BOTTLE</h5>		<p>Featuring our friendly Canadian beaver mascot. Sized perfectly for lunchboxes, kids’ sports, and healthy family hydration.</p>			<h3>“A Taste of Home in Every Bottle: It’s Canada in a bottle.”</h3>					<h6>BPA Free • 100% Recyclable • Naturally Alkaline Canadian Spring Water</h6>','Products','','publish','closed','closed','','products','','','2026-11-25 05:39:17','2026-11-25 05:39:17','',0,'https://canadaehwater.com/?page_id=17',0,'page','',0),(19,1,'2025-12-07 17:23:54','2025-12-07 17:23:54','CONNECT WITH OUR CONCIERGE					<h1>Contact Canada Eh! Water</h1>		<p>Whether you are inquiring about luxury hospitality distribution, executive corporate partnerships, or private delivery for your family, our dedicated concierge team is at your service.</p>			<h2>Send Us a Message</h2>		<p>Fill in your details below and a client advisor will reply within 24 hours.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 384 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M172.268 501.67C26.97 291.031 0 269.413 0 192 0 85.961 85.961 0 192 0s192 85.961 192 192c0 77.413-26.97 99.031-172.268 309.67-9.535 13.774-29.93 13.773-39.464 0zM192 272c44.183 0 80-35.817 80-80s-35.817-80-80-80-80 35.817-80 80 35.817 80 80 80z\"></path></svg>			\n							Corporate Headquarters					<h3>8 Charlotte Street, Toronto, ON</h3>		<p>Waterfront Communities, Ontario, Canada. Serving global luxury markets.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M502.3 190.8c3.9-3.1 9.7-.2 9.7 4.7V400c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H48c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V195.6c0-5 5.7-7.8 9.7-4.7 22.4 17.4 52.1 39.5 154.1 113.6 21.1 15.4 56.7 47.8 92.2 47.6 35.7.3 72-32.8 92.3-47.6 102-74.1 131.6-96.3 154-113.7zM256 320c23.2.4 56.6-29.2 73.4-41.4 132.7-96.3 142.8-104.7 173.4-128.7 5.8-4.5 9.2-11.5 9.2-18.9v-19c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48H48C21.5 64 0 85.5 