 1 Litre</h3>					<h5>1000 ML (1 LITRE)</h5>		<p>Our flagship size for full-day hydration, active routines, and dining tables. Perfectly balanced natural electrolytes in food-grade RPET.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.43_PM__1_-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>PREMIUM TABLE SIZE</h6>					<h3>Signature 750 ML</h3>					<h5>750 ML</h5>		<p>Sleek and tall presentation. Engineered for executive desks, restaurants, and hospitality with crystal clarity and smooth taste.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.43_PM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>DAILY ON-THE-GO</h6>					<h3>Signature 500 ML</h3>					<h5>500 ML</h5>		<p>The classic everyday bottle. Lightweight, ergonomic grip, and perfect for carrying in bags, cars, and gym sessions.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_9.09.27_AM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>LUXURY HOSPITALITY</h6>					<h3>Diamond Embossed</h3>					<h5>500 ML</h5>		<p>Distinctive diamond-patterned bottle reflecting light like Canadian glacial ice. Designed for hotels, VIP venues, and fine dining.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.44_PM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>COMPACT SIZE</h6>					<h3>Signature 296 ML</h3>					<h5>296 ML</h5>		<p>Convenient smaller format for quick hydration, conference tables, and on-the-move refreshment without excess weight.</p>			<h5>SUSTAINABLE ALUMINUM &amp; SPECIAL EDITIONS</h5>					<h2>Cans &amp; Designer Editions</h2>							\n																	<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.44_PM__1_-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>SIGNATURE EDITION</h6>					<h3>Snowflake Gold Can</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Sleek gold recyclable aluminum can containing pure non-carbonated spring water. Chills rapidly and stays crisp longer.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_9.09.04_AM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>GLACIAL EDITION</h6>					<h3>Snowflake White Can</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Clean alpine white aluminum can featuring our Canadian maple snowflake motif. Light, recyclable, and infinitely sustainable.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-05_at_1.24.47_PM-removebg-preview.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>WELLNESS &amp; BEAUTY</h6>					<h3>Women’s Edition</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Blush pink designer can paired with our silky, skin-hydrating natural spring water. Tailored for spas, boutiques, and wellness centers.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-05_at_1.24.47_PM__1_-removebg-preview.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>EXECUTIVE &amp; PERFORMANCE</h6>					<h3>Men’s Edition</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Matte black aluminum can with gold accents. Bold presentation for gyms, boardroom meetings, and performance recovery.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-06_at_11.43.50_AM-removebg-preview.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>FOR LITTLE ONES</h6>					<h3>Kids Edition</h3>					<h5>296 ML BOTTLE</h5>		<p>Featuring our friendly Canadian beaver mascot. Sized perfectly for lunchboxes, kids’ sports, and healthy family hydration.</p>			<h3>“A Taste of Home in Every Bottle: It’s Canada in a bottle.”</h3>					<h6>BPA Free • 100% Recyclable • Naturally Alkaline Canadian Spring Water</h6>','Products','','inherit','closed','closed','','17-revision-v1','','','2026-11-25 05:39:17','2026-11-25 05:39:17','',17,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1496',0,'revision','',0),(1584,1,'2026-11-26 06:04:59','2026-11-26 06:04:59','<p>Private Travel Assistance Service: Ocanada.com provides guided document review and application support. We are not affiliated with the Government of Canada or IRCC.</p>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M383.8 351.7c2.5-2.5 105.2-92.4 105.2-92.4l-17.5-7.5c-10-4.9-7.4-11.5-5-17.4 2.4-7.6 20.1-67.3 20.1-67.3s-47.7 10-57.7 12.5c-7.5 2.4-10-2.5-12.5-7.5s-15-32.4-15-32.4-52.6 59.9-55.1 62.3c-10 7.5-20.1 0-17.6-10 0-10 27.6-129.6 27.6-129.6s-30.1 17.4-40.1 22.4c-7.5 5-12.6 5-17.6-5C293.5 72.3 255.9 0 255.9 0s-37.5 72.3-42.5 79.8c-5 10-10 10-17.6 5-10-5-40.1-22.4-40.1-22.4S183.3 182 183.3 192c2.5 10-7.5 17.5-17.6 10-2.5-2.5-55.1-62.3-55.1-62.3S98.1 167 95.6 172s-5 9.9-12.5 7.5C73 177 25.4 167 25.4 167s17.6 59.7 20.1 67.3c2.4 6 5 12.5-5 17.4L23 259.3s102.6 89.9 105.2 92.4c5.1 5 10 7.5 5.1 22.5-5.1 15-10.1 35.1-10.1 35.1s95.2-20.1 105.3-22.6c8.7-.9 18.3 2.5 18.3 12.5S241 512 241 512h30s-5.8-102.7-5.8-112.8 9.5-13.4 18.4-12.5c10 2.5 105.2 22.6 105.2 22.6s-5-20.1-10-35.1 0-17.5 5-22.5z\"></path></svg>			\n							Ocanada.com					<a href=\"#portals\">Portals</a>					<a href=\"#how-it-works\">How It Works</a>					<a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a>					<a href=\"#faq\">FAQ</a>										<a href=\"#apply-portal\">\n									Start Application\n					</a>\n									CANADIAN TRAVEL AUTHORIZATION &amp; VISA PORTAL					<h1>Simple, Guided Entry to Canada</h1>		<p>Select the travel authorization portal that matches your trip. Our specialists verify your information for completeness and accuracy before su