d document checklists, multilingual guidance, and dedicated email support throughout your process.			<h3>How soon will I receive updates?</h3>		Most eTA reviews are completed within 24 hours. Visitor Visa timelines depend on your country of residence and official processing schedules.					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M383.8 351.7c2.5-2.5 105.2-92.4 105.2-92.4l-17.5-7.5c-10-4.9-7.4-11.5-5-17.4 2.4-7.6 20.1-67.3 20.1-67.3s-47.7 10-57.7 12.5c-7.5 2.4-10-2.5-12.5-7.5s-15-32.4-15-32.4-52.6 59.9-55.1 62.3c-10 7.5-20.1 0-17.6-10 0-10 27.6-129.6 27.6-129.6s-30.1 17.4-40.1 22.4c-7.5 5-12.6 5-17.6-5C293.5 72.3 255.9 0 255.9 0s-37.5 72.3-42.5 79.8c-5 10-10 10-17.6 5-10-5-40.1-22.4-40.1-22.4S183.3 182 183.3 192c2.5 10-7.5 17.5-17.6 10-2.5-2.5-55.1-62.3-55.1-62.3S98.1 167 95.6 172s-5 9.9-12.5 7.5C73 177 25.4 167 25.4 167s17.6 59.7 20.1 67.3c2.4 6 5 12.5-5 17.4L23 259.3s102.6 89.9 105.2 92.4c5.1 5 10 7.5 5.1 22.5-5.1 15-10.1 35.1-10.1 35.1s95.2-20.1 105.3-22.6c8.7-.9 18.3 2.5 18.3 12.5S241 512 241 512h30s-5.8-102.7-5.8-112.8 9.5-13.4 18.4-12.5c10 2.5 105.2 22.6 105.2 22.6s-5-20.1-10-35.1 0-17.5 5-22.5z\"></path></svg>			\n							Ocanada.com		<p>Legal Disclaimer: Ocanada.com is a private, independent travel and visa assistance consultancy. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC) or the Government of Canada. Official applications can also be submitted directly at canada.ca without our guided review service.</p>			<p>Privacy Policy  •  Terms of Service  •  Refund Policy  •  © 2026 Ocanada.com. All rights reserved.</p>','Ocanada.com — Canada eTA & Visitor Visa Portal','','inherit','closed','closed','','1498-revision-v1','','','2026-11-26 06:04:59','2026-11-26 06:04:59','',1498,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1584',0,'revision','',0),(1588,1,'2026-11-26 06:50:07','2026-11-26 06:50:07','<p>Private Travel Assistance Service: Ocanada.com provi