IAL EDITION</h6>					<h3>Snowflake White Can</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Clean alpine white aluminum can featuring our Canadian maple snowflake motif. Light, recyclable, and infinitely sustainable.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-05_at_1.24.47_PM-removebg-preview.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>WELLNESS &amp; BEAUTY</h6>					<h3>Women’s Edition</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Blush pink designer can paired with our silky, skin-hydrating natural spring water. Tailored for spas, boutiques, and wellness centers.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-05_at_1.24.47_PM__1_-removebg-preview.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>EXECUTIVE &amp; PERFORMANCE</h6>					<h3>Men’s Edition</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Matte black aluminum can with gold accents. Bold presentation for gyms, boardroom meetings, and performance recovery.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-06_at_11.43.50_AM-removebg-preview.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>FOR LITTLE ONES</h6>					<h3>Kids Edition</h3>					<h5>296 ML BOTTLE</h5>		<p>Featuring our friendly Canadian beaver mascot. Sized perfectly for lunchboxes, kids’ sports, and healthy family hydration.</p>			<h3>“A Taste of Home in Every Bottle: It’s Canada in a bottle.”</h3>					<h6>BPA Free • 100% Recyclable • Naturally Alkaline Canadian Spring Water</h6>','Products','','inherit','closed','closed','','17-revision-v1','','','2026-11-25 05:01:21','2026-11-25 05:01:21','',17,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1449',0,'revision','',0),(1450,1,'2026-11-25 05:01:22','2026-11-25 05:01:22','<h4>CANADIAN SPRING WATER COLLECTION</h4>					<h1>Our Premium Products</h1>							\n				<p>Pure, naturally alkaline Canadian spring water bottled 