</h2>','e1','','inherit','closed','closed','','344-revision-v1','','','2025-12-08 16:10:10','2025-12-08 16:10:10','',344,'https://canadaehwater.com/?p=346',0,'revision','',0),(347,1,'2025-12-08 16:10:32','2025-12-08 16:10:32','<h1>PURE SPRING PROTECTED IN CANADA</h1>		<p>Sourced from remote, untouched nature, straight from the heart of Canada.</p>													<img width=\"1600\" height=\"1027\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2.webp 1600w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-300x193.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-1024x657.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-768x493.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-1536x986.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" />																					\n						Canada 					\n					<cite>– Every bottle, a hand to someone at home</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Canada_Pantone.svg.webp\" alt=\"– Every bottle, a hand to someone at home\">\n						Portugal 					\n					<cite>– Fresh water, stronger communities</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Portugal_official.svg.png\" alt=\"– Fresh water, stronger communities\">\n						Monaco					\n					<cite> – Pure water, clean shores</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Monaco-flag.jpg\" alt=\" – Pure water, clean shores\">\n						Luxembourg 					\n					<cite>– Hydration that protects tomorrow</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Luxembourg-Flag.jpg\" alt=\"– Hydration that protects tomorrow\">\n						Singapore 					\n					<cite>– One bottle, many futures</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Singapore-1.svg\" alt=\"– One bottle, many futures\">\n						Dubai 					\n					<cite>– Pure water for a cleaner Gulf</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_the_United_Arab_Emirates.svg.png\" alt=\"– Pure water for a cleaner Gulf\">\n									<h2>Each Drop Matters</h2>							\n							Protected Canadian Spring Zones						\n									<p>\n						This water comes from government-protected spring regions that the public cannot access. Untouched land, controlled access, and naturally preserved for decades only approved facilities can reach it.					</p>\n							Why It’s Truly “Magical”						\n									<p>\n						Its journey began thousands of years ago as glacial melt slowly moves through untouched mountain rock. No machine, no filter, no human can re-create this process. You’re drinking fresh pure &amp; healthy water shaped by nature long before cities existed.					</p>\n							Naturally High pH (No Artificial Boosts)						\n									<p>\n						Most brands artificially add minerals to “increase” pH.\nOurs is naturally alkaline because the land itself is rich. A high natural pH helps calm acidity, supports digestion, and keeps your energy stable.					</p>\n							Zero Acidity, Zero Heavy Feeling						\n									<p>\n						Because minerals are naturally balanced, the water enters the body smoothly no bloating, no stomach burn, no “heavy” hydration. Just clean, fast absorption, we added nothing and removed nothing.					</p>\n							Pure &amp; Unedited Nothing Added, Nothing Removed						\n									<p>\n						No mineral injections. No softening. No manipulation!\nThis is water exactly as nature created it the closest thing to ancient hydration in today\'s world, this is not smart or modern water it’s ancient real water.\n					</p>\n							Canada’s Strict Standards = Absolute Safety						\n									<p>\n						Canada is one of the strictest countries for bottled water.\nNo microplastics. No PFAS. No shortcuts. Every bottle meets the same safety level used in hospitals and food-grade labs.					</p>\n							Performs in Extreme Heat &amp; Cold						\n									<p>\n						Naturally balanced electrolytes protect your body whether you\'re in Gulf heat or a cold climate like North America or Europe. No dehydration rebound, no mineral shock just stable hydration.					</p>\n							Safe for Every Age &amp; Lifestyle						\n									<p>\n						Because it’s soft, clean, and alkaline, it’s perfect for:</br>\nathletes</br>\npregnant women</br>\nkids</br>\nelderly</br>\npeople fasting or dieting</br>\nThis is family-friendly premium hydration.\n					</p>\n							Fresh Bottling, No Refills Ever!						\n									<p>\n						Some brands refill or store water for long periods.\nOurs is freshly bottled for every order, no reuse, no mystery sources, no tap water mixes. It goes straight from our protected Canadian springs to your door with no third-party handling.\n					</p>\n							 High-Grade RPET Flavor Protection + Safety						\n									<p>\n						Our bottles meet strict Canadian compliance.\nThey prevent taste changes, protect against plastic leaching, and stay environmentally responsible at the same time.\n					</p>\n							Silky, Light Taste Not Bitter or Metallic						\n									<p>\n						Because the rock filtration is natural, the taste is soft, silky, and pure no metallic finish, no chemical aftertaste. Sensitive clients instantly notice the difference.					</p>\n							Daily Internal Cleaning Effect						\n									<p>\n						The balanced alkalinity + natural minerals help reduce acidity, flush toxins, ease bloating, and stabilize hydration without stressing the kidneys.					</p>\n							Rare Source, Not Industrial						\n									<p>\n						It’s not an industrial lake, not a mass-production river.\nThis spring has a unique mineral fingerprint, no other water in the world has the same natural composition.\n					</p>\n							Trusted by Premium Sectors in Canada &amp; Internationally						\n									<p>\n						Our water used by spas, hotels, wellness centers, private clinics, and premium businesses across Canada and Europe for the last decade. It’s a standard for clients who expect quality.					</p>\n							Fast Cellular Absorption = Natural Energy Boost						\n									<p>\n						The minerals and pH help your cells absorb water instantly.\nThis gives a clean, natural energy lift without coffees or energy drinks.\n					</p>\n							Perfect for Fasting, Detoxing, &amp; Weight Balance						\n									<p>\n						It keeps the body alkaline and light ideal for detox periods, dieting, Supports fasting and weight-balance routines due to clean absorption, high-performance days, and fitness programs.					</p>\n							Skin-Glow Hydration Effect						\n									<p>\n						Pure, balanced water improves the skin barrier.\nMany clients notice brighter skin, smoother texture, and better hydration after a week of daily use.\n					</p>\n							No Mineral Crust or Residue						\n									<p>\n						When you boil it in a kettle, you see no white powder, no crust, no stains, a rare sign of correct mineral balance and purity.					</p>\n							<h2>With Canada Eh! every sip refreshes your body, and every drop quietly changes something around you “</h2>					<h2>The 8 “Crazy” Emotional Benefits (Included in your product pitch)</h2>							\n							1. After-Work out Shock Absorption						\n									<p>\n						Your muscles absorb this water in seconds you feel the refresh hit your body. Other waters leave you thirsty again.					</p>\n							2. Empty-Stomach Lightness Effect						\n									<p>\n						One bottle on an empty stomach instantly activates digestion, clears brain fog, and reduces heaviness and upset stomachs.					</p>\n							3. Nervous System Calm						\n									<p>\n						Its natural mineral balance and stable pH help calm the nervous system. A client in Dubai drinks it after a stressful meeting and feels an immediate physical ease the body responds fast to clean, low-acid, naturally balanced water.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ChatGPT-Image-Dec-1_-2025_-09_35_24-AM.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ChatGPT-Image-Dec-1_-2025_-09_35_24-AM.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ChatGPT-Image-Dec-1_-2025_-09_35_24-AM-300x300.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ChatGPT-Image-Dec-1_-2025_-09_35_24-AM-150x150.webp 150w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ChatGPT-Image-Dec-1_-2025_-09_35_24-AM-768x768.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />																		\n							4. Pure Canadian Origin = Direct Energy						\n									<p>\n						This is 100% Canadian water, straight from protected springs to your door no third party, no editing. You feel the clarity.					</p>\n							5. Night Hydration (No Morning Dryness)						\n									<p>\n						Drink half a bottle before bed and wake up hydrated unlike acidic water that causes dryness and headaches.					</p>\n							6. Zero Residue = Zero Stress on the Body						\n									<p>\n						Boil it, and the kettle stays clean proof of purity.\nPeople are shocked the first time they see it.\n					</p>\n							7. Skin Barrier Support						\n									<p>\n						Balanced TDS + alkalinity = more hydrated skin with a natural glow.\nPerfect for people living in hot, dry climates.\n					</p>\n							8. “It Fits the Body” Feeling						\n									<p>\n						No heaviness. No metallic taste. No bloating.\nIt feels like your body recognizes it immediately because it’s natural.\n					</p>\n							9. Naturally Low Sodium = Safe Hydration						\n									<p>\n						This water protects the body instead of stressing it.\nLow sodium supports stable blood pressure, heart health, and clean hydration even for people on strict diets.\nYou drink it and feel hydrated without the salt load that other waters hide.\n					</p>\n							10. Perfect TDS Zone (119 mg/L) = Deep Hydration						\n									<p>\n						Most waters fail here:\n– too low TDS feels “empty”\n– too high TDS feels heavy and causes bloating\nYours sits in the exact scientific sweet spot.\nYour cells absorb it quickly, giving a clean, smooth hydration that feels natural to the body.\n					</p>\n							11. Naturally Ozonated = Clean Without Chemicals						\n									<p>\n						No chlorine. No harsh disinfectants.\nThe natural ozone level (0.2 ppm) keeps the water protected and fresh while staying gentle for the body.\nIt feels clean, crisp, and light pure safety without chemical taste or chemical methods.\n					</p>','benifits','','publish','closed','closed','','benifits','','','2025-12-08 16:10:33','2025-12-08 16:10:33','',0,'https://canadaehwater.com/?elementor_library=benifits',0,'elementor_library','',0),(348,1,'2025-12-08 16:10:32','2025-12-08 16:10:32','','benifits','','inherit','closed','closed','','347-revision-v1','','','2025-12-08 16:10:32','2025-12-08 16:10:32','',347,'https://canadaehwater.com/?p=348',0,'revision','',0),(349,1,'2025-12-08 16:10:33','2025-12-08 16:10:33','<h1>PURE SPRING PROTECTED IN CANADA</h1>		<p>Sourced from remote, untouched nature, straight from the heart of Canada.</p>													<img width=\"1600\" height=\"1027\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2.webp 1600w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-300x193.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-1024x657.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-768x493.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-1536x986.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" />																					\n						Canada 					\n					<cite>– Every bottle, a hand to someone at home</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Canada_Pantone.svg.webp\" alt=\"– Every bottle, a hand to someone at home\">\n						Portugal 					\n					<cite>– Fresh water, stronger communities</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Portugal_official.svg.png\" alt=\"– Fresh water, stronger communities\">\n						Monaco					\n					<cite> – Pure water, clean shores</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Monaco-flag.jpg\" alt=\" – Pure water, clean shores\">\n						Luxembourg 					\n					<cite>– Hydration that protects tomorrow</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Luxembourg-Flag.jpg\" alt=\"– Hydration that protects tomorrow\">\n						Singapore 					\n					<cite>– One bottle, many futures</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Singapore-1.svg\" alt=\"– One bottle, many futures\">\n						Dubai 					\n					<cite>– Pure water for a cleaner Gulf</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_the_United_Arab_Emirates.svg.png\" alt=\"– Pure water for a cleaner Gulf\">\n									<h2>Each Drop Matters</h2>							\n							Protected Canadian Spring Zones						\n									<p>\n						This water comes from government-protected spring regions that the public cannot access. Untouched land, controlled access, and naturally preserved for decades only approved facilities can reach it.					</p>\n							Why It’s Truly “Magical”						\n									<p>\n						Its journey began thousands of years ago as glacial melt slowly moves through untouched mountain rock. No machine, no filter, no human can re-create this process. You’re drinking fresh pure &amp; healthy water shaped by nature long before cities existed.					</p>\n							Naturally High pH (No Artificial Boosts)						\n									<p>\n						Most brands artificially add minerals to “increase” pH.\nOurs is naturally alkaline because the land itself is rich. A high natural pH helps calm acidity, supports digestion, and keeps your energy stable.					</p>\n							Zero Acidity, Zero Heavy Feeling						\n									<p>\n						Because minerals are naturally balanced, the water enters the body smoothly no bloating, no stomach burn, no “heavy” hydration. Just clean, fast absorption, we added nothing and removed nothing.					</p>\n							Pure &amp; Unedited Nothing Added, Nothing Removed						\n									<p>\n						No mineral injections. No softening. No manipulation!\nThis is water exactly as nature created it the closest thing to ancient hydration in today\'s world, this is not smart or modern water it’s ancient real water.\n					</p>\n							Canada’s Strict Standards = Absolute Safety						\n									<p>\n						Canada is one of the strictest countries for bottled water.\nNo microplastics. No PFAS. No shortcuts. Every bottle meets the same safety level used in hospitals and food-grade labs.					</p>\n							Performs in Extreme Heat &amp; Cold						\n									<p>\n						Naturally balanced electrolytes protect your body whether you\'re in Gulf heat or a cold climate like North America or Europe. No dehydration rebound, no mineral shock just stable hydration.					</p>\n							Safe for Every Age &amp; Lifestyle						\n									<p>\n						Because it’s soft, clean, and alkaline, it’s perfect for:</br>\nathletes</br>\npregnant women</br>\nkids</br>\nelderly</br>\npeople fasting or dieting</br>\nThis is family-friendly premium hydration.\n					</p>\n							Fresh Bottling, No Refills Ever!						\n									<p>\n						Some brands refill or store water for long periods.\nOurs is freshly bottled for every order, no reuse, no mystery sources, no tap water mixes. It goes straight from our protected Canadian springs to your door with no third-party handling.\n					</p>\n							 High-Grade RPET Flavor Protection + Safety						\n									<p>\n						Our bottles meet strict Canadian compliance.\nThey prevent taste changes, protect against plastic leaching, and stay environmentally responsible at the same time.\n					</p>\n							Silky, Light Taste Not Bitter or Metallic						\n									<p>\n						Because the rock filtration is natural, the taste is soft, silky, and pure no metallic finish, no chemical aftertaste. Sensitive clients instantly notice the difference.					</p>\n							Daily Internal Cleaning Effect						\n									<p>\n						The balanced alkalinity + natural minerals help reduce acidity, flush toxins, ease bloating, and stabilize hydration without stressing the kidneys.					</p>\n							Rare Source, Not Industrial						\n									<p>\n						It’s not an industrial lake, not a mass-production river.\nThis spring has a unique mineral fingerprint, no other water in the world has the same natural composition.\n					</p>\n							Trusted by Premium Sectors in Canada &amp; Internationally						\n									<p>\n						Our water used by spas, hotels, wellness centers, private clinics, and premium businesses across Canada and Europe for the last decade. It’s a standard for clients who expect quality.					</p>\n							Fast Cellular Absorption = Natural Energy Boost						\n									<p>\n						The minerals and pH help your cells absorb water instantly.\nThis gives a clean, natural energy lift without coffees or energy drinks.\n					</p>\n							Perfect for Fasting, Detoxing, &amp; Weight Balance						\n									<p>\n						It keeps the body alkaline and light ideal for detox periods, dieting, Supports fasting and weight-balance routines due to clean absorption, high-performance days, and fitness programs.					</p>\n							Skin-Glow Hydration Effect						\n									<p>\n						Pure, balanced water improves the skin barrier.\nMany clients notice brighter skin, smoother texture, and better hydration after a week of daily use.\n					</p>\n							No Mineral Crust or Residue						\n									<p>\n						When you boil it in a kettle, you see no white powder, no crust, no stains, a rare sign of correct mineral balance and purity.					</p>\n							<h2>With Canada Eh! every sip refreshes your body, and every drop quietly changes something around you “</h2>					<h2>The 8 “Crazy” Emotional Benefits (Included in your product pitch)</h2>							\n							1. After-Work out Shock Absorption						\n									<p>\n						Your muscles absorb this water in seconds you feel the refresh hit your body. Other waters leave you thirsty again.					</p>\n							2. Empty-Stomach Lightness Effect						\n									<p>\n						One bottle on an empty stomach instantly activates digestion, clears brain fog, and reduces heaviness and upset stomachs.					</p>\n							3. Nervous System Calm						\n									<p>\n						Its natural mineral balance and stable pH help calm the nervous system. A client in Dubai drinks it after a stressful meeting and feels an immediate physical ease the body responds fast to clean, low-acid, naturally balanced water.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ChatGPT-Image-Dec-1_-2025_-09_35_24-AM.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ChatGPT-Image-Dec-1_-2025_-09_35_24-AM.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ChatGPT-Image-Dec-1_-2025_-09_35_24-AM-300x300.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ChatGPT-Image-Dec-1_-2025_-09_35_24-AM-150x150.webp 150w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ChatGPT-Image-Dec-1_-2025_-09_35_24-AM-768x768.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />																		\n							4. Pure Canadian Origin = Direct Energy						\n									<p>\n						This is 100% Canadian water, straight from protected springs to your door no third party, no editing. You feel the clarity.					</p>\n							5. Night Hydration (No Morning Dryness)						\n									<p>\n						Drink half a bottle before bed and wake up hydrated unlike acidic water that causes dryness and headaches.					</p>\n							6. Zero Residue = Zero Stress on the Body						\n									<p>\n						Boil it, and the kettle stays clean proof of purity.\nPeople are shocked the first time they see it.\n					</p>\n							7. Skin Barrier Support						\n									<p>\n						Balanced TDS + alkalinity = more hydrated skin with a natural glow.\nPerfect for people living in hot, dry climates.\n					</p>\n							8. “It Fits the Body” Feeling						\n									<p>\n						No heaviness. No metallic taste. No bloating.\nIt feels like your body recognizes it immediately because it’s natural.\n					</p>\n							9. Naturally Low Sodium = Safe Hydration						\n									<p>\n						This water protects the body instead of stressing it.\nLow sodium supports stable blood pressure, heart health, and clean hydration even for people on strict diets.\nYou drink it and feel hydrated without the salt load that other waters hide.\n					</p>\n							10. Perfect TDS Zone (119 mg/L) = Deep Hydration						\n									<p>\n						Most waters fail here:\n– too low TDS feels “empty”\n– too high TDS feels heavy and causes bloating\nYours sits in the exact scientific sweet spot.\nYour cells absorb it quickly, giving a clean, smooth hydration that feels natural to the body.\n					</p>\n							11. Naturally Ozonated = Clean Without Chemicals						\n									<p>\n						No chlorine. No harsh disinfectants.\nThe natural ozone level (0.2 ppm) keeps the water protected and fresh while staying gentle for the body.\nIt feels clean, crisp, and light pure safety without chemical taste or chemical methods.\n					</p>','benifits','','inherit','closed','closed','','347-revision-v1','','','2025-12-08 16:10:33','2025-12-08 16:10:33','',347,'htt