7-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Exceptional quality in every bottle</h3>															<img width=\"887\" height=\"1774\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png 887w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1-150x300.png 150w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1-512x1024.png 512w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1-768x1536.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 887px) 100vw, 887px\" />																CANADA EH! WATER					<h3>Pure Canadian Spring Water</h3>		<p>Harvested from protected Canadian spring zones. Pure, balanced, and bottled fresh at source.</p>			ELEVATE YOUR EVERYDAY HYDRATION					<h2>Experience Authentic Canadian Refreshment</h2>		<p>Discover our collection of premium Canadian spring water bottles, crafted for mindful living and refined taste.</p>								<a href=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/products/\">\n									Explore Our Collection\n					</a>','Why It’s Magical Water','','inherit','closed','closed','','13-revision-v1','','','2026-11-25 05:06:06','2026-11-25 05:06:06','',13,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1451',0,'revision','',0),(1495,1,'2026-11-25 05:39:17','2026-11-25 05:39:17','<h4>CANADIAN SPRING WATER COLLECTION</h4>					<h1>Our Premium Products</h1>							\n				<p>Pure, naturally alkaline Canadian spring water bottled directly at the source in government protected lands. Available in premium food-grade RPET bottles and sleek recyclable aluminum cans.</p>			<h5>PURE CANADIAN SPRING WATER</h5>					<h2>Signature Bottle Collection</h2>							\n																	<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.43_PM__2_-removebg-preview-1.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>FLAGSHIP BOTTLE</h6>					<h3>Signature 1 Litre</h3>					<h5>1000 ML (1 LITRE)</h5>		<p>Our flagship size for full-day hydration, active routines, and dining tables. Perfectly balanced natural electrolytes in food-grade RPET.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.43_PM__1_-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>PREMIUM TABLE SIZE</h6>					<h3>Signature 750 ML</h3>					<h5>750 ML</h5>		<p>Sleek and tall presentation. Engineered for executive desks, restaurants, and hospitality with crystal clarity and smooth taste.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.43_PM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>DAILY ON-THE-GO</h6>					<h3>Signature 500 ML</h3>					<h5>500 ML</h5>		<p>The classic everyday bottle. Lightweight, ergonomic grip, and perfect for carrying in bags, cars, and gym sessions.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_9.09.27_AM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>LUXURY HOSPITALITY</h6>					<h3>Diamond Embossed</h3>					<h5>500 ML</h5>		<p>Distinctive diamond-patterned bottle reflecting light like Canadian glacial ice. Designed for hotels, VIP venues, and fine dining.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.44_PM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>COMPACT SIZE</h6>					<h3>Signature 296 ML</h3>					<h5>296 ML</h5>		<p>Convenient smaller format for quick hydration, conference tables, and on-the-move refreshment without excess weight.</p>			<h5>SUSTAINABLE ALUMINUM &amp; SPECIAL EDITIONS</h5>					<h2>Cans &amp; Designer Editions</h2>							\n																	<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.44_PM__1_-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>SIGNATURE EDITION</h6>					<h3>Snowflake Gold Can</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Sleek gold recyclable aluminum can containing pure non-carbonated spring water. Chills rapidly and stays crisp longer.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_9.09.04_AM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>GLACIAL EDITION</h6>					<h3>Snowflake White Can</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Clean alpine white aluminum can featuring our Canadian maple snowflake motif. Light, recyclable, and infinitely sustainable.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-05_at_1.24.47_PM-removebg-preview.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>WELLNESS &amp; BEAUTY</h6>					<h3>Women’s Edition</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Blush pink designer can paired with our silky, skin-hydrating natural spring water. Tailored for spas, boutiques, and wellness centers.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-05_at_1.24.47_PM__1_-removebg-preview.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>EXECUTIVE &amp; PERFORMANCE</h6>					<h3>Men’s Edition</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Matte black aluminum can with gold accents. Bold presentation for gyms, boardroom meetings, and performance recovery.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-06_at_11.43.50_AM-removebg-preview.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>FOR LITTLE ONES</h6>					<h3>Kids Edition</h3>					<h5>296 ML BOTTLE</h5>		<p>Featuring our friendly Canadian beaver mascot. Sized perfectly for lunchboxes, kids’ sports, and healthy family hydration.</p>			<h3>“A Taste of Home in Every Bottle: It’s Canada in a bottle.”</h3>					<h6>BPA Free • 100% Recyclable • Naturally Alkaline Canadian Spring Water</h6>','Products','','inherit','closed','closed','','17-revision-v1','','','2026-11-25 05:39:17','2026-11-25 05:39:17','',17,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1495',0,'revision','',0),(1337,0,'2026-11-24 13:22:24','2026-11-24 13:22:24','','Marcus Reed','','inherit','open','closed','','marcus-reed','','','2026-11-24 13:22:24','2026-11-24 13:22:24','',0,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/marcus_reed_circle.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(1338,0,'2026-11-24 13:22:24','2026-11-24 13:22:24','','Emily Hughes','','inherit','open','closed','','emily-hughes','','','2026-11-24 13:22:24','2026-11-24 13:22:24','',0,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/emily_hughes_circle.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(1339,0,'2026-11-24 13:22:24','2026-11-24 13:22:24','','Alex Morgan','','inherit','open','closed','','alex-morgan','','','2026-11-24 13:22:24','2026-11-24 13:22:24','',0,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/alex_morgan_circle.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(1340,0,'2026-11-24 13:22:24','2026-11-24 13:22:24','','David Miller','','inherit','open','closed','','david-miller','','','2026-11-24 13:22:24','2026-11-24 13:22:24','',0,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/david_miller_circle.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(1477,1,'2026-11-25 05:11:07','2026-11-25 05:11:07','CONNECT WITH OUR CONCIERGE					<h1>Contact Canada Eh! Water</h1>		<p>Whether you are inquiring about luxury hospitality distribution, executive corporat