ty, gourmet grocers, and discerning clientele across Europe and the Middle East.</p>													<img width=\"1344\" height=\"768\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_monaco.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_monaco.jpg 1344w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_monaco-300x171.jpg 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_monaco-1024x585.jpg 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_monaco-768x439.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1344px) 100vw, 1344px\" />																MONACO					<h3>Premier Luxury European Retail</h3>															<img width=\"1344\" height=\"768\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_uae.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_uae.jpg 1344w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_uae-300x171.jpg 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_uae-1024x585.jpg 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_uae-768x439.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1344px) 100vw, 1344px\" />																UNITED ARAB EMIRATES					<h3>Exclusive Middle East Hospitality &amp; Markets</h3>															<img width=\"1344\" height=\"768\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_portugal.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_portugal.jpg 1344w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_portugal-300x171.jpg 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_portugal-1024x585.jpg 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_portugal-768x439.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1344px) 100vw, 1344px\" />																PORTUGAL					<h3>Leading Continental Supermarkets</h3>					THE GUARDIANS OF PURITY					<h2>Meet Our Team</h2>		<p>The Canada Eh! Water team is united by a shared commitment to purity, responsibility, and respect for nature. Each member plays a vital role in ensuring our water remains untouched, protected, and delivered with care: from source to sip.</p>													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/marcus_reed_circle.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/marcus_reed_circle.png 600w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/marcus_reed_circle-300x300.png 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/marcus_reed_circle-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h3>Marcus Reed</h3>					Operations Manager							\n				<p>Oversees production, quality control, and cold-chain logistics across all protected spring bottling zones.</p>													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/emily_hughes_circle.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/emily_hughes_circle.png 600w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/emily_hughes_circle-300x300.png 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/emily_hughes_circle-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h3>Emily Hughes</h3>					Quality &amp; Compliance Coordinator							\n				<p>Ensures uncompromising safety standards, batch documentation, and biological purity consistency.</p>													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/alex_morgan_circle.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/alex_morgan_circle.png 600w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/alex_morgan_circle-300x300.png 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/alex_morgan_circle-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h3>Alex Morgan</h3>					Sales &amp; Partnerships Manager							\n				<p>Handles client relations, luxury hospitality accounts, fine dining distributors, and global partnerships.</p>													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/david_miller_circle.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/david_miller_circle.png 600w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/david_miller_circle-300x300.png 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/david_miller_circle-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h3>David Miller</h3>					Supply &amp; Logistics Coordinator							\n				<p>Manages medical-grade RPET inventory, international shipments, and reliable global supplier coordination.</p>			ELEVATE YOUR STANDARD					<h2>Ready to Experience Truly Pristine Water?</h2>		<p>Discover our collection of premium Canadian spring water bottles, harvested from nature’s purest glacial reserves.</p>								<a href=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/products/\">\n									Explore Our Collection\n					</a>','Contact us','','inherit','closed','closed','','19-revision-v1','','','2026-11-25 05:12:25','2026-11-25 05:12:25','',19,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1479',0,'revision','',0),(1437,1,'2026-11-25 04:49:23','2026-11-25 04:49:23','CANADIAN HERITAGE • NATURE\'S ORIGINAL CHARACTER					<h1>The 18 Pillars of Our Pure Advantage</h1>		<p>Inspired by Canada\'s remarkable natural heritage, shaped by nature, and presented with distinction. Discover the eighteen foundational standards that define Canada EH! Water.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M383.8 351.7c2.5-2.5 105.2-92.4 105.2-92.4l-17.5-7.5c-10-4.9-7.4-11.5-5-17.4 2.4-7.6 20.1-67.3 20.1-67.3s-47.7 10-57.7 12.5c-7.5 2.4-10-2.5-12.5-7.5s-15-32.4-15-32.4-52.6 59.9-55.1 62.3c-10 7.5-20.1 0-17.6-10 0-10 27.6-129.6 27.6-129.6s-30.1 17.4-40.1 22.4c-7.5 5-12.6 5-17.6-5C293.5 72.3 255.9 0 255.9 0s-37.5 72.3-42.5 79.8c-5 10-10 10-17.6 5-10-5-40.1-22.4-40.1-22.4S183.3 182 183.3 192c2.5 10-7.5 17.5-17.6 10-2.5-2.5-55.1-62.3-55.1-62.3S98.1 167 95.6 172s-5 9.9-12.5 7.5C73 177 25.4 167 25.4 167s17.6 59.7 20.1 67.3c2.4 6 5 12.5-5 17.4L23 259.3s102.6 89.9 105.2 92.4c5.1 5 10 7.5 5.1 22.5-5.1 15-10.1 35.1-10.1 35.1s95.2-20.1 105.3-22.6c8.7-.9 18.3 2.5 18.3 12.5S241 512 241 512h30s-5.8-102.7-5.8-112.8 9.5-13.4 18.4-12.5c10 2.5 105.2 22.6 105.2 22.6s-5-20.1-10-35.1 0-17.5 5-22.5z\"></path></svg>			\n							PILLAR 01					<h3>Protected Canadian Spring Sources</h3>		<p>Our journey begins in carefully protected Canadian spring environments, where controlled access and responsible sourcing help preserve the natural character of the surrounding landscape.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M634.92 462.7l-288-448C341.03 5.54 330.89 0 320 0s-21.03 5.54-26.92 14.7l-288 448a32.001 32.001 0 0 0-1.17 32.64A32.004 32.004 0 0 0 32 512h576c11.71 0 22.48-6.39 28.09-16.67a31.983 31.983 0 0 0-1.17-32.63zM320 91.18L405.39 224H320l-64 64-38.06-38.06L320 91.18z\"></path></svg>			\n							PILLAR 02					<h3>A Masterpiece Shaped by Nature</h3>		<p>Inspired by Canada\'s remarkable geological heritage, our spring water travels through natural rock formations, developing its distinctive mineral profile through a process shaped by nature itself.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M496 384H64V80c0-8.84-7.16-16-16-16H16C7.16 64 0 71.16 0 80v336c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h464c8.84 0 16-7.16 16-16v-32c0-8.84-7.16-16-16-16zM464 96H345.94c-21.38 0-32.09 25.85-16.97 40.97l32.4 32.4L288 242.75l-73.37-73.37c-12.5-12.5-32.76-12.5-45.25 0l-68.69 68.69c-6.25 6.25-6.25 16.38 0 22.63l22.62 22.62c6.25 6.25 16.38 6.25 22.63 0L192 237.25l73.37 73.37c12.5 12.5 32.76 12.5 45.25 0l96-96 32.4 32.4c15.12 15.12 40.97 4.41 40.97-16.97V112c.01-8.84-7.15-16-15.99-16z\"></path></svg>			\n							PILLAR 03					<h3>Naturally Alkaline by Origin</h3>		<p>Our naturally alkaline character comes from the mineral composition of the source rather than artificial pH enhancement. It is a distinctive quality that reflects the richness of Canada\'s natural environment.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M512 0C460.22 3.56 96.44 38.2 71.01 287.61c-3.09 26.66-4.84 53.44-5.99 80.24l178.87-178.69c6.25-6.25 16.4-6.25 22.65 0s6.25 16.38 0 22.63L7.04 471.03c-9.38 9.37-9.38 24.57 0 33.94 9.38 9.37 24.59 9.37 33.98 0l57.13-57.07c42.09-.14 84.15-2.53 125.96-7.36 53.48-5.44 97.02-26.47 132.58-56.54H255.74l146.79-48.88c11.25-14.89 21.37-30.71 30.45-47.12h-81.14l106.54-53.21C500.29 132.86 510.19 26.26 512 0z\"></path></svg>			\n							PILLAR 04					<h3>An Exceptionally Refreshing Experience</h3>		<p>A delicate mineral balance creates a light, pleasant drinking experience. Every sip offers a refined sense of freshness, making it an enjoyable choice throughout the day.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M562.1 383.9c-21.5-2.4-42.1-10.5-57.9-22.9-14.1-11.1-34.2-11.3-48.2 0-37.9 30.4-107.2 30.4-145.7-1.5-13.5-11.2-33-9.1-46.7 1.8-38 30.1-106.9 30-145.2-1.7-13.5-11.2-33.3-8.9-47.1 2-15.5 12.2-36 20.1-57.7 22.4-7.9.8-13.6 7.8-13.6 15.7v32.2c0 9.1 7.6 16.8 16.7 16 28.8-2.5 56.1-11.4 79.4-25.9 56.5 34.6 137 34.1 192 0 56.5 34.6 137 34.1 192 0 23.3 14.2 50.9 23.3 79.1 25.8 9.1.8 16.7-6.9 16.7-16v-31.6c.1-8-5.7-15.4-13.8-16.3zm0-144c-21.5-2.4-42.1-10.5-57.9-22.9-14.1-11.1-34.2-11.3-48.2 0-37.9 30.4-107.2 30.4-145.7-1.5-13.5-11.2-33-9.1-46.7 1.8-38 30.1-106.9 30-145.2-1.7-13.5-11.2-33.3-8.9-47.1 2-15.5 12.2-36 20.1-57.7 22.4-7.9.8-13.6 7.8-13.6 15.7v32.2c0 9.1 7.6 16.8 16.7 16 28.8-2.5 56.1-11.4 79.4-25.9 56.5 34.6 137 34.1 192 0 56.5 34.6 137 34.1 192 0 23.3 14.2 50.9 23.3 79.1 25.8 9.1.8 16.7-6.9 16.7-16v-31.6c.1-8-5.7-15.4-13.8-16.3zm0-144C540.6 93.4 520 85.4 504.2 73 490.1 61.9 470 61.7 456 73c-37.9 30.4-107.2 30.4-145.7-1.5-13.5-11.2-33-9.1-46.7 1.8-38 30.1-106.9 30-145.2-1.7-13.5-11.2-33.3-8.9-47.1 2-15.5 12.2-36 20.1-57.7 22.4-7.9.8-13.6 7.8-13.6 15.7v32.2c0 9.1 7.6 16.8 16.7 16 28.8-2.5 56.1-11.4 79.4-25.9 56.5 34.6 137 34.1 192 0 56.5 34.6 137 34.1 192 0 23.3 14.2 50.9 23.3 79.1 25.8 9.1.8 16.7-6.9 16.7-16v-31.6c.1-8-5.7-15.4-13.8-16.3z\"></path></svg>			\n							PILLAR 05					<h3>Authenticity Without Unnecessary Alteration</h3>		<p>We believe exceptional spring water should retain its original character. Our approach prioritizes naturally occurring minerals without unnecessary artificial enhancement or reformulation.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M466.5 83.7l-192-80a48.15 48.15 0 0 0-36.9 0l-192 80C27.7 91.1 16 108.6 16 128c0 198.5 114.5 335.7 221.5 380.3 11.8 4.9 25.1 4.9 36.9 0C360.1 472.6 496 349.3 496 128c0-19.4-11.7-36.9-29.5-44.3zM256.1 446.3l-.1-381 175.9 73.3c-3.3 151.4-82.1 261.1-175.8 307.7z\"></path></svg>			\n							PILLAR 06					<h3>Quality Guided by Canadian Standards</h3>		<p>Our commitment to quality is built around applicable Canadian bottled water and food safety requirements, with responsible production practices and attention to detail throughout the bottling process.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 0c-52.9 0-96 43.1-96 96s43.1 96 96 96 96-43.1 96-96-43.1-96-96-96zm0 128c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32s14.3-32 32-32 32 14.3 32 32-14.3 32-32 32zm-160-16C256 50.1 205.9 0 144 0S32 50.1 32 112v166.5C12.3 303.2 0 334 0 368c0 79.5 64.5 144 144 144s144-64.5 144-144c0-34-12.3-64.9-32-89.5V112zM144 448c-44.1 0-80-35.9-80-80 0-25.5 12.2-48.9 32-63.8V112c0-26.5 21.5-48 48-48s48 21.5 48 48v192.2c19.8 14.8 32 38.3 32 63.8 0 44.1-35.9 80-80 80zm16-125.1V112c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16s-16 7.2-16 16v210.9c-18.6 6.6-32 24.2-32 45.1 0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48s48-21.5 48-48c0-20.9-13.4-38.5-32-45.1z\"></path></svg>			\n							PILLAR 07					<h3>From Northern Winters to Desert Summers</h3>		<p>From the snowy landscapes of Canada to the sun filled destinations of the Arabian Gulf, Canada EH! brings a refreshing Canadian drinking experience to different climates, destinations and everyday occasions.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M96 224c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64s-28.7-64-64-64-64 28.7-64 64 28.7 64 64 64zm448 0c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64s-28.7-64-64-64-64 28.7-64 64 28.7 64 64 64zm32 32h-64c-17.6 0-33.5 7.1-45.1 18.6 40.3 22.1 68.9 62 75.1 109.4h66c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32v-32c0-35.3-28.7-64-64-64zm-256 0c61.9 0 112-50.1 112-112S381.9 32 320 32 208 82.1 208 144s50.1 112 112 112zm76.8 32h-8.3c-20.8 10-43.9 16-68.5 16s-47.6-6-68.5-16h-8.3C179.6 288 128 339.6 128 403.2V432c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h288c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48v-28.8c0-63.6-51.6-115.2-115.2-115.2zm-223.7-13.4C161.5 263.1 145.6 256 128 256H64c-35.3 0-64 28.7-64 64v32c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32h65.9c6.3-47.4 34.9-87.3 75.2-109.4z\"></path></svg>			\n							PILLAR 08					<h3>Designed Around Everyday Life</h3>		<p>From family gatherings and professional meetings to sporting activities and international travel, our collection is designed to complement a wide variety of lifestyles and personal preferences.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M507.31 72.57L439.43 4.69c-6.25-6.25-16.38-6.25-22.63 0l-22.63 22.63c-6.25 6.25-6.25 16.38 0 22.63l-76.67 76.67c-46.58-19.7-102.4-10.73-140.37 27.23L18.75 312.23c-24.99 24.99-24.99 65.52 0 90.51l90.51 90.51c24.99 24.99 65.52 24.99 90.51 0l158.39-158.39c37.96-37.96 46.93-93.79 27.23-140.37l76.67-76.67c6.25 6.25 16.38 6.25 22.63 0l22.63-22.63c6.24-6.24 6.24-16.37-.01-22.62zM179.22 423.29l-90.51-90.51 122.04-122.04 90.51 90.51-122.04 122.04z\"></path></svg>			\n							PILLAR 09					<h3>Bottled with Care, Delivered with Purpose</h3>		<p>Our commitment to freshness begins at the source and continues throughout production, packaging and distribution. Every bottle is intended to deliver a consistent experience, with careful attention to product integrity.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M184.561 261.903c3.232 13.997-12.123 24.635-24.068 17.168l-40.736-25.455-50.867 81.402C55.606 356.273 70.96 384 96.012 384H148c6.627 0 12 5.373 12 12v40c0 6.627-5.373 12-12 12H96.115c-75.334 0-121.302-83.048-81.408-146.88l50.822-81.388-40.725-25.448c-12.081-7.547-8.966-25.961 4.879-29.158l110.237-25.45c8.611-1.988 17.201 3.381 19.189 11.99l25.452 110.237zm98.561-182.915l41.289 66.076-40.74 25.457c-12.051 7.528-9 25.953 4.879 29.158l110.237 25.45c8.672 1.999 17.215-3.438 19.189-11.99l25.45-110.237c3.197-13.844-11.99-24.719-24.068-17.168l-40.687 25.424-41.263-66.082c-37.521-60.033-125.209-60.171-162.816 0l-17.963 28.766c-3.51 5.62-1.8 13.021 3.82 16.533l33.919 21.195c5.62 3.512 13.024 1.803 16.536-3.817l17.961-28.743c12.712-20.341 41.973-19.676 54.257-.022zM497.288 301.12l-27.515-44.065c-3.511-5.623-10.916-7.334-16.538-3.821l-33.861 21.159c-5.62 3.512-7.33 10.915-3.818 16.536l27.564 44.112c13.257 21.211-2.057 48.96-27.136 48.96H320V336.02c0-14.213-17.242-21.383-27.313-11.313l-80 79.981c-6.249 6.248-6.249 16.379 0 22.627l80 79.989C302.689 517.308 320 510.3 320 495.989V448h95.88c75.274 0 121.335-82.997 81.408-146.88z\"></path></svg>			\n							PILLAR 10					<h3>Premium Packaging with Responsibility in Mind</h3>		<p>Our rPET packaging reflects a considered approach to modern bottled water. Combining practical functionality, refined presentation and recyclable materials, our bottles are designed with both consumers and environmental responsibility in mind.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 352 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M205.22 22.09c-7.94-28.78-49.44-30.12-58.44 0C100.01 179.85 0 222.72 0 333.91 0 432.35 78.72 512 176 512s176-79.65 176-178.09c0-111.75-99.79-153.34-146.78-311.82zM176 448c-61.75 0-112-50.25-112-112 0-8.84 7.16-16 16-16s16 7.16 16 16c0 44.11 35.89 80 80 80 8.84 0 16 7.16 16 16s-7.16 16-16 16z\"></path></svg>			\n							PILLAR 11					<h3>A Silky, Delicately Balanced Taste</h3>		<p>Smooth, subtle and refreshingly understated, our distinctive taste reflects its naturally occurring mineral composition. A refined drinking experience without an overpowering mineral finish.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M320.2 243.8l-49.7 99.4c-6 12.1-23.4 11.7-28.9-.6l-56.9-126.3-30 71.7H60.6l182.5 186.5c7.1 7.3 18.6 7.3 25.7 0L451.4 288H342.3l-22.1-44.2zM473.7 73.9l-2.4-2.5c-51.5-52.6-135.8-52.6-187.4 0L256 100l-27.9-28.5c-51.5-52.7-135.9-52.7-187.4 0l-2.4 2.4C-10.4 123.7-12.5 203 31 256h102.4l35.9-86.2c5.4-12.9 23.6-13.2 29.4-.4l58.2 129.3 49-97.9c5.9-11.8 22.7-11.8 28.6 0l27.6 55.2H481c43.5-53 41.4-132.3-7.3-182.1z\"></path></svg>			\n							PILLAR 12					<h3>Elevating the Everyday Water Ritual</h3>		<p>Water is part of life\'s simplest moments. Whether enjoyed in the morning, alongside a meal or during a busy afternoon, Canada EH! transforms an everyday essential into a more considered experience.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M485.5 0L576 160H474.9L405.7 0h79.8zm-128 0l69.2 160H149.3L218.5 0h139zm-267 0h79.8l-69.2 160H0