4-42.99-94.34-96.02z\"></path></svg>			\n							PILLAR 14					<h3>Crafted for Premium Environments</h3>		<p>From luxury hospitality and fine dining to spas, executive offices and exclusive events, our collection is designed to complement environments where presentation, quality and attention to detail matter.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M296 160H180.6l42.6-129.8C227.2 15 215.7 0 200 0H56C44 0 33.8 8.9 32.2 20.8l-32 240C-1.7 275.2 9.5 288 24 288h118.7L96.6 482.5c-3.6 15.2 8 29.5 23.3 29.5 8.4 0 16.4-4.4 20.8-12l176-304c9.3-15.9-2.2-36-20.7-36z\"></path></svg>			\n							PILLAR 15					<h3>Refreshment for Life in Motion</h3>		<p>Busy mornings, demanding schedules, international journeys and active lifestyles deserve a refreshing companion. Canada EH! brings simplicity and sophistication to life\'s most dynamic moments.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M546.2 9.7c-5.6-12.5-21.6-13-28.3-1.2C486.9 62.4 431.4 96 368 96h-80C182 96 96 182 96 288c0 7 .8 13.7 1.5 20.5C161.3 262.8 253.4 224 384 224c8.8 0 16 7.2 16 16s-7.2 16-16 16C132.6 256 26 410.1 2.4 468c-6.6 16.3 1.2 34.9 17.5 41.6 16.4 6.8 35-1.1 41.8-17.3 1.5-3.6 20.9-47.9 71.9-90.6 32.4 43.9 94 85.8 174.9 77.2C465.5 467.5 576 326.7 576 154.3c0-50.2-10.8-102.2-29.8-144.6z\"></path></svg>			\n							PILLAR 16					<h3>A Natural Fit for Mindful Living</h3>		<p>For those who appreciate simplicity and thoughtful daily choices, our water offers a straightforward drinking experience that complements personal routines, fitness activities and balanced lifestyles.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 496 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M248 8C111 8 0 119 0 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S385 8 248 8zM112 223.4c3.3-42.1 32.2-71.4 56-71.4s52.7 29.3 56 71.4c.7 8.6-10.8 11.9-14.9 4.5l-9.5-17c-7.7-13.7-19.2-21.6-31.5-21.6s-23.8 7.9-31.5 21.