55-35.31-9.58L252 502.04c4.39 10.77 18.44 13.4 26.43 4.96l36.25-38.28 52.69 2.01c11.62.44 19.82-11.27 15.43-22.03zM263 340c15.28-15.55 17.03-14.21 38.79-20.14 13.89-3.79 24.75-14.84 28.47-28.98 7.48-28.4 5.54-24.97 25.95-45.75 10.17-10.35 14.14-25.44 10.42-39.58-7.47-28.38-7.48-24.42 0-52.83 3.72-14.14-.25-29.23-10.42-39.58-20.41-20.78-18.47-17.36-25.95-45.75-3.72-14.14-14.58-25.19-28.47-28.98-27.88-7.61-24.52-5.62-44.95-26.41-10.17-10.35-25-14.4-38.89-10.61-27.87 7.6-23.98 7.61-51.9 0-13.89-3.79-28.72.25-38.89 10.61-20.41 20.78-17.05 18.8-44.94 26.41-13.89 3.79-24.75 14.84-28.47 28.98-7.47 28.39-5.54 24.97-25.95 45.75-10.17 10.35-14.15 25.44-10.42 39.58 7.47 28.36 7.48 24.4 0 52.82-3.72 14.14.25 29.23 10.42 39.59 20.41 20.78 18.47 17.35 25.95 45.75 3.72 14.14 14.58 25.19 28.47 28.98C104.6 325.96 106.27 325 121 340c13.23 13.47 33.84 15.88 49.74 5.82a39.676 39.676 0 0 1 42.53 0c15.89 10.06 36.5 7.65 49.73-5.82zM97.66 175.96c0-53.03 42.24-96.02 94.34-96.02s94.34 42.99 94.34 96.02-42.24 96.02-94.34 96.02-94.34-42.99-94.34-96.02z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h2>18 Pillars. One Uncompromising Vision.</h2>		<p>Inspired by Canada. Shaped by nature. Presented with distinction.</p>			<h3>Canada EH! Water: Canadian by Origin. International by Vision.</h3>					ELEVATE YOUR DAILY RITUAL					<h2>Taste The Pure Advantage Today</h2>		<p>Experience the difference that genuine Canadian spring water makes to your daily energy, health, and peace of mind.</p>								<a href=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/products/\">\n									Explore Our Collection\n					</a>','Our Pure Advantage','','inherit','closed','closed','','15-revision-v1','','','2026-11-25 04:49:23','2026-11-25 04:49:23','',15,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1437',0,'revision','',0),(466,2,'2025-12-22 18:44:09','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<h1>PURE SPRING PROTECTED IN CANADA</h1>		<p>Sourced from remote, untouched nature, straight from the heart of Canada.</p>													<img width=\"1600\" height=\"1027\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2.webp 1600w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-300x193.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-1024x657.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-768x493.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-1536x986.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" />																					\n						Canada – Every bottle, a hand to someone at home					\n					<cite>With every bottle sold in Canada, a part of the profit goes toward supporting low-income families, veterans, and people facing homelessness. When you drink Canada Eh! here, you are not just hydrating your body you are helping someone feel seen, supported, and a little less alone in the country we call home.</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Canada_Pantone.svg.webp\" alt=\"With every bottle sold in Canada, a part of the profit goes toward supporting low-income families, veterans, and people facing homelessness. When you drink Canada Eh! here, you are not just hydrating your body you are helping someone feel seen, supported, and a little less alone in the country we call home.\">\n						Portugal – Fresh water, stronger communities					\n					<cite>Portugal has faced heat waves, drought, and rising living costs that hit vulnerable families first. Each bottle of Canada Eh! sold in Portugal helps support local partners working on food support, basic needs, and community projects that protect both people and nature. Every sip is a small “thank you” to a country that opened its doors to the world.</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Portugal_official.svg.png\" alt=\"Portugal has faced heat waves, drought, and rising living costs that hit vulnerable families first. Each bottle of Canada Eh! sold in Portugal helps support local partners working on food support, basic needs, and community projects that protect both people and nature. Every sip is a small “thank you” to a country that opened its doors to the world.\">\n						Monaco – Pure water, clean shores					\n					<cite>Monaco is small in size but huge in responsibility toward the Mediterranean coast. A portion of sales in Monaco will go toward marine and coastal protection projects keeping beaches, bays, and marine life cleaner and healthier. When you choose Canada Eh! in Monaco, you are choosing elegance with a conscience.</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Monaco-flag.jpg\" alt=\"Monaco is small in size but huge in responsibility toward the Mediterranean coast. A portion of sales in Monaco will go toward marine and coastal protection projects keeping beaches, bays, and marine life cleaner and healthier. When you choose Canada Eh! in Monaco, you are choosing elegance with a conscience.\">\n						Luxembourg – Hydration that protects tomorrow					\n					<cite>Luxembourg is green, careful, and future-focused. Our contribution there will be directed toward children’s health and nature-protection initiatives because a healthy future needs both strong kids and protected forests. Every bottle you drink is a quiet investment in the next generation.</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Luxembourg-Flag.jpg\" alt=\"Luxembourg is green, careful, and future-focused. Our contribution there will be directed toward children’s health and nature-protection initiatives because a healthy future needs both strong kids and protected forests. Every bottle you drink is a quiet investment in the next generation.\">\n						Singapore – One bottle, many futures					\n					<cite>Singapore is fast, modern, and smart but not everyone grows up with the same chances. A share of our sales in Singapore will help fund education and youth-development programs, giving more young people access to skills, mentors, and opportunities. While your body feels refreshed, your choice is helping someone else build a different life.</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Singapore-1.svg\" alt=\"Singapore is fast, modern, and smart but not everyone grows up with the same chances. A share of our sales in Singapore will help fund education and youth-development programs, giving more young people access to skills, mentors, and opportunities. While your body feels refreshed, your choice is helping someone else build a different life.\">\n						Dubai – Pure water for a cleaner Gulf					\n					<cite>Dubai’s skyline faces the Gulf, where plastic and pollution are a real problem. With every bottle sold in Dubai, Canada Eh! will support local initiatives focused on beach clean-ups, marine protection, and smarter waste-management around the Gulf. So when you open a cold bottle in the desert heat, you are also helping keep the sea a little cleaner and the coastline a little more alive.</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_the_United_Arab_Emirates.svg.png\" alt=\"Dubai’s skyline faces the Gulf, where plastic and pollution are a real problem. With every bottle sold in Dubai, Canada Eh! will support local initiatives focused on beach clean-ups, marine protection, and smarter waste-management around the Gulf. So when you open a cold bottle in the desert heat, you are also helping keep the sea a little cleaner and the coastline a little more alive.\">\n									<h2>With Canada Eh! every sip refreshes your body, and every drop quietly changes something around you “</h2>','Our Team','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2025-12-22 18:44:09','2025-12-22 18:44:09','',0,'https://canadaehwater.com/?page_id=466',0,'page','',0),(467,2,'2025-12-22 18:44:09','2025-12-22 18:44:09','<h1>PURE SPRING PROTECTED IN CANADA</h1>		<p>Sourced from remote, untouched nature, straight from the heart of Canada.</p>													<img width=\"1600\" height=\"1027\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2.webp 1600w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-300x193.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-1024x657.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-768x493.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/logo-png-2-1536x986.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" />																					\n						Canada – Every bottle, a hand to someone at home					\n					<cite>With every bottle sold in Canada, a part of the profit goes toward supporting low-income families, veterans, and people facing homelessness. When you drink Canada Eh! here, you are not just hydrating your body you are helping someone feel seen, supported, and a little less alone in the country we call home.</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Canada_Pantone.svg.webp\" alt=\"With every bottle sold in Canada, a part of the profit goes toward supporting low-income families, veterans, and people facing homelessness. When you drink Canada Eh! here, you are not just hydrating your body you are helping someone feel seen, supported, and a little less alone in the country we call home.\">\n						Portugal – Fresh water, stronger communities					\n					<cite>Portugal has faced heat waves, drought, and rising living costs that hit vulnerable families first. Each bottle of Canada Eh! sold in Portugal helps support local partners working on food support, basic needs, and community projects that protect both people and nature. Every sip is a small “thank you” to a country that opened its doors to the world.</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Portugal_official.svg.png\" alt=\"Portugal has faced heat waves, drought, and rising living costs that hit vulnerable families first. Each bottle of Canada Eh! sold in Portugal helps support local partners working on food support, basic needs, and community projects that protect both people and nature. Every sip is a small “thank you” to a country that opened its doors to the world.\">\n						Monaco – Pure water, clean shores					\n					<cite>Monaco is small in size but huge in responsibility toward the Mediterranean coast. A portion of sales in Monaco will go toward marine and coastal protection projects keeping beaches, bays, and marine life cleaner and healthier. When you choose Canada Eh! in Monaco, you are choosing elegance with a conscience.</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Monaco-flag.jpg\" alt=\"Monaco is small in size but huge in responsibility toward the Mediterranean coast. A portion of sales in Monaco will go toward marine and coastal protection projects keeping beaches, bays, and marine life cleaner and healthier. When you choose Canada Eh! in Monaco, you are choosing elegance with a conscience.\">\n						Luxembourg – Hydration that protects tomorrow					\n					<cite>Luxembourg is green, careful, and future-focused. Our contribution there will be directed toward children’s health and nature-protection initiatives because a healthy future needs both strong kids and protected forests. Every bottle you drink is a quiet investment in the next generation.</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Luxembourg-Flag.jpg\" alt=\"Luxembourg is green, careful, and future-focused. Our contribution there will be directed toward children’s health and nature-protection initiatives because a healthy future needs both strong kids and protected forests. Every bottle you drink is a quiet investment in the next generation.\">\n						Singapore – One bottle, many futures					\n					<cite>Singapore is fast, modern, and smart but not everyone grows up with the same chances. A share of our sales in Singapore will help fund education and youth-development programs, giving more young people access to skills, mentors, and opportunities. While your body feels refreshed, your choice is helping someone else build a different life.</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Singapore-1.svg\" alt=\"Singapore is fast, modern, and smart but not everyone grows up with the same chances. A share of our sales in Singapore will help fund education and youth-development programs, giving more young people access to skills, mentors, and opportunities. While your body feels refreshed, your choice is helping someone else build a different life.\">\n						Dubai – Pure water for a cleaner Gulf					\n					<cite>Dubai’s skyline faces the Gulf, where plastic and pollution are a real problem. With every bottle sold in Dubai, Canada Eh! will support local initiatives focused on beach clean-ups, marine protection, and smarter waste-management around the Gulf. So when you open a cold bottle in the desert heat, you are also helping keep the sea a little cleaner and the coastline a little more alive.</cite>				\n						<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_the_United_Arab_Emirates.svg.png\" alt=\"Dubai’s skyline faces the Gulf, where plastic and pollution are a real problem. With every bottle sold in Dubai, Canada Eh! will support local initiatives focused on beach clean-ups, marine protection, and smarter waste-management around the Gulf. So when you open a cold bottle in the desert heat, you are also helping keep the sea a little cleaner and the coastline a little more alive.\">\n									<h2>With Canada Eh! every sip refreshes your body, and every drop quietly changes something around you “</h2>','Our Team','','inherit','closed','closed','','466-revision-v1','','','2025-12-22 18:44:09','2025-12-22 18:44:09','',466,'https://canadaehwater.com/?p=467',0,'revision','',0),(485,2,'2025-12-22 18:53:10','2025-12-22 18:53:10','','WhatsApp Image 2025-12-21 at 5.50.34 AM (1)','','inherit','open','closed','','whatsapp-image-2025-12-21-at-5-50-34-am-1','','','2025-12-22 18:53:10','2025-12-22 18:53:10','',19,'https://canadaehwater.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp-Image-2025-12-21-at-5.50.34-AM-1.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(486,2,'2025-12-22 18:53:14','2025-12-22 18:53:14','','WhatsApp Image 2025-12-21 at 5.50.34 AM (2)','','inherit','open','closed','','whatsapp-image-2025-12-21-at-5-50-34-am-2','','','2025-12-22 18:53:14','2025-12-22 18:53:14','',19,'https://canadaehwater.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp-Image-2025-12-21-at-5.50.34-AM-2.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(487,2,'2025-12-22 18:53:17','2025-12-22 18:53:17','','WhatsApp Image 2025-12-21 at 5.50.34 AM (3)','','inherit','open','closed','','whatsapp-image-2025-12-21-at-5-50-34-am-3','','','2025-12-22 18:53:17','2025-12-22 18:53:17','',19,'https://canadaehwater.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp-Image-2025-12-21-at-5.50.34-AM-3.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(488,2,'2025-12-22 18:53:22','2025-12-22 18:53:22','','WhatsApp Image 2025-12-21 at 5.50.34 AM','','inherit','open','closed','','whatsapp-image-2025-12-21-at-5-50-34-am','','','2025-12-22 18:53:22','2025-12-22 18:53:22','',19,'https://canadaehwater.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp-Image-2025-12-21-at-5.50.34-AM.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(501,2,'2025-12-22 19:01:59','2025-12-22 19:01:59','','Untitled design - 2025-12-23T000142.782','','inherit','open','closed','','untitled-design-2025-12-23t000142-782','','','2025-12-22 19:01:59','2025-12-22 19:01:59','',19,'https://canadaehwater.c