ing clientele across Europe and the Middle East.</p>													<img width=\"1344\" height=\"768\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_monaco.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_monaco.jpg 1344w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_monaco-300x171.jpg 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_monaco-1024x585.jpg 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_monaco-768x439.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1344px) 100vw, 1344px\" />																MONACO					<h3>Premier Luxury European Retail</h3>															<img width=\"1344\" height=\"768\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_uae.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_uae.jpg 1344w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_uae-300x171.jpg 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_uae-1024x585.jpg 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_uae-768x439.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1344px) 100vw, 1344px\" />																UNITED ARAB EMIRATES					<h3>Exclusive Middle East Hospitality &amp; Markets</h3>															<img width=\"1344\" height=\"768\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_portugal.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_portugal.jpg 1344w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_portugal-300x171.jpg 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_portugal-1024x585.jpg 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/global_distribution_portugal-768x439.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1344px) 100vw, 1344px\" />																PORTUGAL					<h3>Leading Continental Supermarkets</h3>					THE GUARDIANS OF PURITY					<h2>Meet Our Team</h2>		<p>The Canada Eh! Water team is united by a shared commitment to purity, responsibility, and respect for nature. Each member plays a vital role in ensuring our water remains untouched, protected, and delivered with care: from source to sip.</p>													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/marcus_reed_circle.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/marcus_reed_circle.png 600w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/marcus_reed_circle-300x300.png 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/marcus_reed_circle-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h3>Marcus Reed</h3>					Operations Manager							\n				<p>Oversees production, quality control, and cold-chain logistics across all protected spring bottling zones.</p>													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/emily_hughes_circle.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/emily_hughes_circle.png 600w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/emily_hughes_circle-300x300.png 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/emily_hughes_circle-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h3>Emily Hughes</h3>					Quality &amp; Compliance Coordinator							\n				<p>Ensures uncompromising safety standards, batch documentation, and biological purity consistency.</p>													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/alex_morgan_circle.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.