OME</h3>		<p>Smaller bottle sizes, perfect for schools, kids and daily hydration.</p>			<h2>OUR COMMUNITY COMMITMENT</h2>		<p style=\"margin: 0; text-align: center;\">Giving back to Canada — people, communities, and a brighter future.</p>													<img width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/veteran_saluting_the_canadian_flag_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/veteran_saluting_the_canadian_flag_compressed.webp 1672w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/veteran_saluting_the_canadian_flag_compressed-300x169.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/veteran_saluting_the_canadian_flag_compressed-1024x576.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/veteran_saluting_the_canadian_flag_compressed-768x432.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/veteran_saluting_the_canadian_flag_compressed-1536x864.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1672px) 100vw, 1672px\" />																		\n							<h3>SUPPORTING CANADIAN VETERANS</h3>															<img width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/warmth_shared_a_grateful_meal_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/warmth_shared_a_grateful_meal_compressed.webp 1672w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/warmth_shared_a_grateful_meal_compressed-300x169.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/warmth_shared_a_grateful_meal_compressed-1024x576.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/warmth_shared_a_grateful_meal_compressed-768x432.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/warmth_shared_a_grateful_meal_compressed-1536x864.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1672px) 100vw, 1672px\" />																		