nts, and hospitality with crystal clarity and smooth taste.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.43_PM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>DAILY ON-THE-GO</h6>					<h3>Signature 500 ML</h3>					<h5>500 ML</h5>		<p>The classic everyday bottle. Lightweight, ergonomic grip, and perfect for carrying in bags, cars, and gym sessions.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_9.09.27_AM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>LUXURY HOSPITALITY</h6>					<h3>Diamond Embossed</h3>					<h5>500 ML</h5>		<p>Distinctive diamond-patterned bottle reflecting light like Canadian glacial ice. Designed for hotels, VIP venues, and fine dining.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.44_PM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>COMPACT SIZE</h6>					<h3>Signature 296 ML</h3>					<h5>296 ML</h5>		<p>Convenient smaller format for quick hydration, conference tables, and on-the-move refreshment without excess weight.</p>			<h5>SUSTAINABLE ALUMINUM &amp; SPECIAL EDITIONS</h5>					<h2>Cans &amp; Designer Editions</h2>							\n																	<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_3.15.44_PM__1_-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>SIGNATURE EDITION</h6>					<h3>Snowflake Gold Can</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Sleek gold recyclable aluminum can containing pure non-carbonated spring water. Chills rapidly and stays crisp longer.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-29_at_9.09.04_AM-removebg-preview.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>GLACIAL EDITION</h6>					<h3>Snowflake White Can</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Clean alpine white aluminum can featuring our Canadian maple snowflake motif. Light, recyclable, and infinitely sustainable.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-05_at_1.24.47_PM-removebg-preview.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>WELLNESS &amp; BEAUTY</h6>					<h3>Women’s Edition</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Blush pink designer can paired with our silky, skin-hydrating natural spring water. Tailored for spas, boutiques, and wellness centers.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-05_at_1.24.47_PM__1_-removebg-preview.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>EXECUTIVE &amp; PERFORMANCE</h6>					<h3>Men’s Edition</h3>					<h5>355 ML CAN</h5>		<p>Matte black aluminum can with gold accents. Bold presentation for gyms, boardroom meetings, and performance recovery.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-06_at_11.43.50_AM-removebg-preview.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h6>FOR LITTLE ONES</h6>					<h3>Kids Edition</h3>					<h5>296 ML BOTTLE</h5>		<p>Featuring our friendly Canadian beaver mascot. Sized perfectly for lunchboxes, kids’ sports, and healthy family hydration.</p>			<h3>“A Taste of Home in Every Bottle: It’s Canada in a bottle.”</h3>					<h6>BPA Free • 100% Recyclable • Naturally Alkaline Canadian Spring Water</h6>','Products','','inherit','closed','closed','','17-revision-v1','','','2026-11-25 05:39:17','2026-11-25 05:39:17','',17,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1494',0,'revision','',0),(1013,1,'2026-11-23 08:57:55','2026-11-23 08:57:55','','alpine_lake_tall_compressed','','inherit','open','closed','','alpine_lake_tall_compressed','','','2026-11-23 08:57:55','2026