08','<h1>Untouched\nMagical Water\nFrom Canada</h1>		<p>Born in the Protected Springs of Canada</p>								<a href=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/our-story/\">\n									About us\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"887\" height=\"1774\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png 887w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1-150x300.png 150w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1-512x1024.png 512w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1-768x1536.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 887px) 100vw, 887px\" />																		\n			Your digestion calms.			\n				0\n				%\n			Your system unclogs.			\n				0\n				%\n			 Your energy rises.			\n				0\n				%\n			Your skin looks fresher.			\n				0\n				%\n							<h3>بلدية دبي </br>\nDubai Municipality</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M446.7 98.6l-67.6 318.8c-5.1 22.5-18.4 28.1-37.3 17.5l-103-75.9-49.7 47.8c-5.5 5.5-10.1 10.1-20.7 10.1l7.4-104.9 190.9-172.5c8.3-7.4-1.8-11.5-12.9-4.1L117.8 284 16.2 252.2c-22.1-6.9-22.5-22.1 4.6-32.7L418.2 66.4c18.4-6.9 34.5 4.1 28.5 32.2z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>TESTED &amp; PASSED BY DUBAI MUNICIPALITY</h3>							\n												<a href=\"#\">\n									SOLD IN THE UAE AS A PREMIUM WATER\n					</a>\n									<h3>CANADIAN SPRING SOURCE TESTED</h3>															<img width=\"48\" height=\"36\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gg-flag-canada.png\" alt=\"\" />																<h3>(Based on the attached\nlab reports)</h3>							\n							<h3>FROM RAIN &amp; MELTED SNOW</h3>		<p style=\"margin: 0; text-align: center;\">A natural blend of Canada\'s pristine rain and snowmelt that feeds our protected spring source.</p>			<h3>PURE MOUNTAIN SPRING WATER</h3>		<p style=\"margin: 0; text-align: center;\">Naturally filtered as it flows through ancient rock layers, carrying essential minerals to your home.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M383.8 351.7c2.5-2.5 105.2-92.4 105.2-92.4l-17.5-7.5c-10-4.9-7.4-11.5-5-17.4 2.4-7.6 20.1-67.3 20.1-67.3s-47.7 10-57.7 12.5c-7.5 2.4-10-2.5-12.5-7.5s-15-32.4-15-32.4-52.6 59.9-55.1 62.3c-10 7.5-20.1 0-17.6-10 0-10 27.6-129.6 27.6-129.6s-30.1 17.4-40.1 22.4c-7.5 5-12.6 5-17.6-5C293.5 72.3 255.9 0 255.9 0s-37.5 72.3-42.5 79.8c-5 10-10 10-17.6 5-10-5-40.1-22.4-40.1-22.4S183.3 182 183.3 192c2.5 10-7.5 17.5-17.6 10-2.5-2.5-55.1-62.3-55.1-62.3S98.1 167 95.6 172s-5 9.9-12.5 7.5C73 177 25.4 167 25.4 167s17.6 59.7 20.1 67.3c2.4 6 5 12.5-5 17.4L23 259.3s102.6 89.9 105.2 92.4c5.1 5 10 7.5 5.1 22.5-5.1 15-10.1 35.1-10.1 35.1s95.2-20.1 105.3-22.6c8.7-.9 18.3 2.5 18.3 12.5S241 512 241 512h30s-5.8-102.7-5.8-112.8 9.5-13.4 18.4-12.5c10 2.5 105.2 22.6 105.2 22.6s-5-20.1-10-35.1 0-17.5 5-22.5z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>BOTTLED IN CANADA</h3>		Under strict Canadian hygiene and quality standards.					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M466.5 83.7l-192-80a48.15 48.15 0 0 0-36.9 0l-192 80C27.7 91.1 16 108.6 16 128c0 198.5 114.5 335.7 221.5 380.3 11.8 4.9 25.1 4.9 36.9 0C360.1 472.6 496 349.3 496 128c0-19.4-11.7-36.9-29.5-44.3zM256.1 446.3l-.1-381 175.9 73.3c-3.3 151.4-82.1 261.1-175.8 307.7z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>ONGOING WATER TESTING</h3>		<p style=\"margin: 0; text-align: center;\">We test our water regularly to keep our quality and promises.</p>					\n							<h3>NATURAL MINERALS</h3>		Contains naturally occurring minerals like Calcium and Magnesium.													<img width=\"1774\" height=\"887\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-c