p>No payment is charged on this page until your details are reviewed.</p>					COMMON QUESTIONS					<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>					<h3>What is the difference between eTA and Visitor Visa?</h3>		An eTA is for visa-exempt travelers flying to Canada, while a Visitor Visa (TRV) is required for citizens of non-exempt countries entering Canada by air, land, or sea.			<h3>Is Ocanada.com part of the Canadian Government?</h3>		No. Ocanada.com is an independent private travel assistance platform. You may also apply directly through the official Government of Canada (IRCC) website.			<h3>What does the service fee include?</h3>		Our service fee covers expert pre-submission accuracy checks, tailored document checklists, multilingual guidance, and dedicated email support throughout your process.			<h3>How soon will I receive updates?</h3>		Most eTA reviews are completed within 24 hours. Visitor Visa timelines depend on your country of residence and official processing schedules.					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M383.8 351.7c2.5-2.5 105.2-92.4 105.2-92.4l-17.5-7.5c-10-4.9-7.4-11.5-5-17.4 2.4-7.6 20.1-67.3 20.1-67.3s-47.7 10-57.7 12.5c-7.5 2.4-10-2.5-12.5-7.5s-15-32.4-15-32.4-52.6 59.9-55.1 62.3c-10 7.5-20.1 0-17.6-10 0-10 27.6-129.6 27.6-129.6s-30.1 17.4-40.1 22.4c-7.5 5-12.6 5-17.6-5C293.5 72.3 255.9 0 255.9 0s-37.5 72.3-42.5 79.8c-5 10-10 10-17.6 5-10-5-40.1-22.4-40.1-22.4S183.3 182 183.3 192c2.5 10-7.5 17.5-17.6 10-2.5-2.5-55.1-62.3-55.1-62.3S98.1 167 95.6 172s-5 9.9-12.5 7.5C73 177 25.4 167 25.4 167s17.6 59.7 20.1 67.3c2.4 6 5 12.5-5 17.4L23 259.3s102.6 89.9 105.2 92.4c5.1 5 10 7.5 5.1 22.5-5.1 15-10.1 35.1-10.1 35.1s95.2-20.1 105.3-22.6c8.7-.9 18.3 2.5 18.3 12.5S241 512 241 512h30s-5.8-102.7-5.8-112.8 9.5-13.4 18.4-12.5c10 2.5 105.2 22.6 105.2 22.6s-5-20.1-10-35.1 0-17.5 5-22.5z\"></path></svg>			\n							Ocanada.com		<p>Legal Disclaimer: Ocanada.com is a private, independent travel and visa assi