el assistance platform. You may also apply directly through the official Government of Canada (IRCC) website.			<h3>What does the service fee include?</h3>		Our service fee covers expert pre-submission accuracy checks, tailored document checklists, multilingual guidance, and dedicated email support throughout your process.			<h3>How soon will I receive updates?</h3>		Most eTA reviews are completed within 24 hours. Visitor Visa timelines depend on your country of residence and official processing schedules.					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M383.8 351.7c2.5-2.5 105.2-92.4 105.2-92.4l-17.5-7.5c-10-4.9-7.4-11.5-5-17.4 2.4-7.6 20.1-67.3 20.1-67.3s-47.7 10-57.7 12.5c-7.5 2.4-10-2.5-12.5-7.5s-15-32.4-15-32.4-52.6 59.9-55.1 62.3c-10 7.5-20.1 0-17.6-10 0-10 27.6-129.6 27.6-129.6s-30.1 17.4-40.1 22.4c-7.5 5-12.6 5-17.6-5C293.5 72.3 255.9 0 255.9 0s-37.5 72.3-42.5 79.8c-5 10-10 10-17.6 5-10-5-40.1-22.4-40.1-22.4S183.3 182 183.3 192c2.5 10-7.5 17.5-17.6 10-2.5-2.5-55.1-62.3-55.1-62.3S98.1 167 95.6 172s-5 9.9-12.5 7.5C73 177 25.4 167 25.4 167s17.6 59.7 20.1 67.3c2.4 6 5 12.5-5 17.4L23 259.3s102.6 89.9 105.2 92.4c5.1 5 10 7.5 5.1 22.5-5.1 15-10.1 35.1-10.1 35.1s95.2-20.1 105.3-22.6c8.7-.9 18.3 2.5 18.3 12.5S241 512 241 512h30s-5.8-102.7-5.8-112.8 9.5-13.4 18.4-12.5c10 2.5 105.2 22.6 105.2 22.6s-5-20.1-10-35.1 0-17.5 5-22.5z\"></path></svg>			\n							Ocanada.com		<p>Legal Disclaimer: Ocanada.com is a private, independent travel and visa assistance consultancy. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC) or the Government of Canada. Official applications can also be submitted directly at canada.ca without our guided review service.</p>			<p>Privacy Policy  •  Terms of Service  •  Refund Policy  •  © 2026 Ocanada.com. All rights reserved.</p>','Ocanada.com — Canada eTA & Visitor Visa Portal','','inherit','closed','closed','','1498-revision-v1','','','2026-11-26 06:50:07','2026-11-26 06:50:07','',1498,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1587',0,'revision','',0),(1249,1,'2026-11-24 12:04:37','2026-11-24 12:04:37','','dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed','','inherit','open','closed','','dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed','','','2026-11-24 12:04:37','2026-11-24 12:04:37','',11,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1250,1,'2026-11-24 12:05:16','2026-11-24 12:05:16','','laboratory_no_gradient_compressed','','inherit','open','closed','','laboratory_no_gradient_compressed','','','2026-11-24 12:05:16','2026-11-24 12:05:16','',11,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1272,1,'2026-11-24 12:12:19','2026-11-24 12:12:19','<h4>AUTHENTIC CANADIAN HERITAGE</h4>					<h1>Born From Our Family, Born From the Land</h1>							\n				<p>A proudly Canadian brand inspired by our family\'s story, Canada\'s natural beauty, and the genuine kindness of its people.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER ONE &bull; THE 1990s</h5>					<h2>A Simple Word That Stayed With Us</h2>		<p>Our story began in the 1990s, when our father frequently traveled between Canada and the United States for business.</p><p>During his travels, he visited a few small Canadian towns, driving through beautiful forests, quiet country roads, and peaceful communities where people welcomed him with warm smiles and a familiar Canadian expression:</p>			“Beautiful day, eh?”					“Good water, eh?”					“Tastes fresh, eh?”		<p>That simple word, <strong>“Eh!”</strong>, stayed with him. It represented something special about Canada: its friendly people, welcoming communities, and natural beauty.</p><p>One day, while exploring Canada\'s beautiful wilderness, he discovered spring water that tasted exceptionally fresh, clean, and naturally smooth. He described that moment in a few simple words:</p>			<h4>“This is what purity tastes like. This feels like home.”</h4>		<p>That experience inspired a dream: to share the natural freshness of Canadian spring water with people around the world. Years later, our family decided to turn that dream into reality, with one clear mission: <strong>To bring premium Canadian spring water to the world while preserving its natural quality, purity, and character.</strong></p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/canadian_road_journey.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h5>CANADA IN A BOTTLE</h5>					<h3>Pure Canadian Spring Water</h3>		<p>Protected by Canadian government source lands, filtered naturally through mountain rock and ice.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER TWO &bull; PROVEN STANDARDS</h5>					<h2>Quality Proven, Not Just Promised</h2>		<p>A great story is important, but for us, a great story isn\'t enough. Quality must be proven, not just promised. Our quality is supported by rigorous international testing, official documentation, and an unwavering commitment to doing things properly.</p>													<img width=\"1916\" height=\"821\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed.webp 1916w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-300x129.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-1024x439.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-768x329.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-1536x658.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1916px) 100vw, 1916px\" />																<h3>Dubai Government Laboratory Testing (2026)</h3>							\n				<p>In 2026, our Canadian spring water underwent laboratory testing in Dubai, United Arab Emirates, where it successfully passed the required tests.</p><p>The results were documented in official reports issued by a Dubai government laboratory, and those records remain permanently on file as proof of our international standards.</p>													<img width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed.webp 1672w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-300x169.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-1024x576.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-768x432.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-1536x864.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1672px) 100vw, 1672px\" />																<h3>Canadian Testing &amp; Naturally Occurring Minerals</h3>							\n				<p>Our water has passed applicable Canadian testing and regulatory requirements. We continue to test our water periodically as part of our commitment to maintaining consistent quality and safety.</p><p>What makes Canada Eh! special is its natural mineral content: carefully bottled with as little human handling as possible, preserving the calcium, magnesium, and natural qualities that make it unique.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER THREE &bull; GLOBAL REACH</h5>					<h2>From Canada to the World</h2>		<p>Today, Canada Eh! is expanding its presence internationally, bringing premium Canadian spring water to businesses and homes in Dubai and across the UAE, Portugal, and other European markets.</p><p>While our international journey continues to grow, we have taken a more gradual approach in Canada, our home market, focusing on building a strong foundation and lasting relationships.</p><p>We believe that meaningful growth takes time. Our goal has never been simply to sell more bottles, but to build a Canadian brand that people can recognize, trust, and feel proud to support.</p>			<h4>OUR CORE FAMILY VALUES</h4>					<h6>01</h6>					<h4>Purity</h4>		<p>Natural spring water from government-protected Canadian lands, preserved without artificial processing.</p>			<h6>02</h6>					<h4>Respect</h4>		<p>Deep respect for the land, our home communities, and every country where our bottles are sold.</p>			<h6>03</h6>					<h4>Honesty</h4>		<p>Transparency in all we do, backed by verified laboratory documentation and rigorous standards.</p>			<h6>04</h6>					<h4>Quality</h4>		<p>Carefully bottled with minimal human contact, preserving balanced natural calcium and magnesium.</p>			<h6>05</h6>					<h4>And a touch of “Eh!”</h4>		<p>The genuine warmth, hospitality, and welcoming kindness of the Canadian spirit in every single drop.</p>			<h4>“No matter how far our water travels, our roots will always remain Canadian.”</h4>					<h5>A Taste of Home in Every Bottle &bull; “It’s Canada in a bottle.”</h5>','Our Story','','inherit','closed','closed','','11-revision-v1','','','2026-11-24 12:12:19','2026-11-24 12:12:19','',11,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1272',0,'revision','',0),(1274,1,'2026-11-24 12:12:20','2026-11-24 12:12:20','<h4>AUTHENTIC CANADIAN HERITAGE</h4>					<h1>Born From Our Family, Born From the Land</h1>							\n				<p>A proudly Canadian brand inspired by our family\'s story, Canada\'s natural beauty, and the genuine kindness of its people.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER ONE &bull; THE 1990s</h5>					<h2>A Simple Word That Stayed With Us</h2>		<p>Our story began in the 1990s, when our father frequently traveled between Canada and the United States for business.</p><p>During his travels, he visited a few small Canadian towns, driving through beautiful forests, quiet country roads, and peaceful communities where people welcomed him with warm smiles and a familiar Canadian expression:</p>			“Beautiful day, eh?”					“Good water, eh?”					“Tastes fresh, eh?”		<p>That simple word, <strong>“Eh!”</strong>, stayed with him. It represented something special about Canada: its friendly people, welcoming communities, and natural beauty.</p><p>One day, while exploring Canada\'s beautiful wilderness, he discovered spring water that tasted exceptionally fresh, clean, and naturally smooth. He described that moment in a few simple words:</p>			<h4>“This is what purity tastes like. This feels like home.”</h4>		<p>That experience inspired a dream: to share the natural freshness of Canadian spring water with people around the world. Years later, our family decided to turn that dream into reality, with one clear mission: <strong>To bring premium Canadian spring water to the world while preserving its natural quality, purity, and character.</strong></p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/canadian_road_journey.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h5>CANADA IN A BOTTLE</h5>					<h3>Pure Canadian Spring Water</h3>		<p>Protected by Canadian government source lands, filtered naturally through mountain rock and ice.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER TWO &bull; PROVEN STANDARDS</h5>					<h2>Quality Proven, Not Just Promised</h2>		<p>A great story is important, but for us, a great story isn\'t enough. Quality must be proven, not just promised. Our quality is supported by rigorous international testing, official documentation, and an unwavering commitment to doing things properly.</p>													<img width=\"1916\" height=\"821\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed.webp 1916w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-300x129.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-1024x439.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-768x329.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-1536x658.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1916px) 100vw, 1916px\" />																<h3>Dubai Government Laboratory Testing (2026)</h3>							\n				<p>In 2026, our Canadian spring water underwent laboratory testing in Dubai, United Arab Emirates, where it successfully passed the required tests.</p><p>The results were documented in official reports issued by a Dubai government laboratory, and those records remain permanently on file as proof of our international standards.</p>													<img width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed.webp 1672w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-300x169.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-1024x576.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-768x432.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-1536x864.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1672px) 100vw, 1672px\" />																<h3>Canadian Testing &amp; Naturally Occurring Minerals</h3>							\n				<p>Our water has passed applicable Canadian testing and regulatory requirements. We continue to test our water periodically as part of our commitment to maintaining consistent quality and safety.</p><p>What makes Canada Eh! special is its natural mineral content: carefully bottled with as little human handling as possible, preserving the calcium, magnesium, and natural qualities that make it unique.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER THREE &bull; GLOBAL REACH</h5>					<h2>From Canada to the World</h2>		<p>Today, Canada Eh! is expanding its presence internationally, bringing premium Canadian spring water to businesses and homes in Dubai and across the UAE, Portugal, and other European markets.</p><p>While our international journey continues to grow, we have taken a more gradual approach in Canada, our home market, focusing on building a strong foundation and lasting relationships.</p><p>We believe that meaningful growth takes time. Our goal has never been simply to sell more bottles, but to build a Canadian brand that people can recognize, trust, and feel proud to support.</p>			<h4>OUR CORE FAMILY VALUES</h4>					<h6>01</h6>					<h4>Purity</h4>		<p>Natural spring water from government-protected Canadian lands, preserved without artificial processing.</p>			<h6>02</h6>					<h4>Respect</h4>		<p>Deep respect for the land, our home communities, and every country where our bottles are sold.</p>			<h6>03</h6>					<h4>Honesty</h4>		<p>Transparency in all we do, backed by verified laboratory documentation and rigorous standards.</p>			<h6>04</h6>					<h4>Quality</h4>		<p>Carefully bottled with minimal human contact, preserving balanced natural calcium and magnesium.</p>			<h6>05</h6>					<h4>And a touch of “Eh!”</h4>		<p>The genuine warmth, hospitality, and welcoming kindness of the Canadian spirit in every single drop.</p>			<h4>“No matter how far our water travels, our roots will always remain Canadian.”</h4>					<h5>A Taste of Home in Every Bottle &bull; “It’s Canada in a bottle.”</h5>','Our Story','','inherit','closed','closed','','11-revision-v1','','','2026-11-24 12:12:20','2026-11-24 12:12:20','',11,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1274',0,'revision','',0),(1278,1,'2026-11-24 12:12:53','2026-11-24 12:12:53','<h4>AUTHENTIC CANADIAN HERITAGE</h4>					<h1>Born From Our Family, Born From the Land</h1>							\n				<p>A proudly Canadian brand inspired by our family\'s story, Canada\'s natural beauty, and the genuine kindness of its people.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER ONE &bull; THE 1990s</h5>					<h2>A Simple Word That Stayed With Us</h2>		<p>Our story began in the 1990s, when our father frequently traveled between Canada and the United States for business.</p><p>During his travels, he visited a few small Canadian towns, driving through beautiful forests, quiet country roads, and peaceful communities where people welcomed him with warm smiles and a familiar Canadian expression:</p>			“Beautiful day, eh?”					“Good water, eh?”					“Tastes fresh, eh?”		<p>That simple word, <strong>“Eh!”</strong>, stayed with him. It represented something special about Canada: its friendly people, welcoming communities, and natural beauty.</p><p>One day, while exploring Canada\'s beautiful wilderness, he discovered spring water that tasted exceptionally fresh, clean, and naturally smooth. He described that moment in a few simple words:</p>			<h4>“This is what purity tastes like. This feels like home.”</h4>		<p>That experience inspired a dream: to share the natural freshness of Canadian spring water with people around the world. Years later, our family decided to turn that dream into reality, with one clear mission: <strong>To bring premium Canadian spring water to the world while preserving its natural quality, purity, and character.</strong></p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/canadian_road_journey.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h5>CANADA IN A BOTTLE</h5>					<h3>Pure Canadian Spring Water</h3>		<p>Protected by Canadian government source lands, filtered naturally through mountain rock and ice.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER TWO &bull; PROVEN STANDARDS</h5>					<h2>Quality Proven, Not Just Promised</h2>		<p>A great story is important, but for us, a great story isn\'t enough. Quality must be proven, not just promised. Our quality is supported by rigorous international testing, official documentation, and an unwavering commitment to doing things properly.</p>													<img width=\"1916\" height=\"821\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed.webp 1916w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-300x129.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-1024x439.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-768x329.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-1536x658.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1916px) 100vw, 1916px\" />																<h3>Dubai Government Laboratory Testing (2026)</h3>							\n				<p>In 2026, our Canadian spring water underwent laboratory testing in Dubai, United Arab Emirates, where it successfully passed the required tests.</p><p>The results were documented in official reports issued by a Dubai government laboratory, and those records remain permanently on file as proof of our international standards.</p>													<img width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed.webp 1672w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-300x169.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-1024x576.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-768x432.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-1536x864.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1672px) 100vw, 1672px\" />																<h3>Canadian Testing &amp; Naturally Occurring Minerals</h3>							\n				<p>Our water has passed applicable Canadian testing and regulatory requirements. We continue to test our water periodically as part of our commitment to maintaining consistent quality and safety.</p><p>What makes Canada Eh! special is its natural mineral content: carefully bottled with as little human handling as possible, preserving the calcium, magnesium, and natural qualities that make it unique.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER THREE &bull; GLOBAL REACH</h5>					<h2>From Canada to the World</h2>		<p>Today, Canada Eh! is expanding its presence internationally, bringing premium Canadian spring water to businesses and homes in Dubai and across the UAE, Portugal, and other European markets.</p><p>While our international journey continues to grow, we have taken a more gradual approach in Canada, our home market, focusing on building a strong foundation and lasting relationships.</p><p>We believe that meaningful growth takes time. Our goal has never been simply to sell more bottles, but to build a Canadian brand that people can recognize, trust, and feel proud to support.</p>			<h4>OUR CORE FAMILY VALUES</h4>					<h6>01</h6>					<h4>Purity</h4>		<p>Natural spring water from government-protected Canadian lands, preserved without artificial processing.</p>			<h6>02</h6>					<h4>Respect</h4>		<p>Deep respect for the land, our home communities, and every country where our bottles are sold.</p>			<h6>03</h6>					<h4>Honesty</h4>		<p>Transparency in all we do, backed by verified laboratory documentation and rigorous standards.</p>			<h6>04</h6>					<h4>Quality</h4>		<p>Carefully bottled with minimal human contact, preserving balanced natural calcium and magnesium.</p>			<h6>05</h6>					<h4>And a touch of “Eh!”</h4>		<p>The genuine warmth, hospitality, and welcoming kindness of the Canadian spirit in every single drop.</p>			<h4>“No matter how far our water travels, our roots will always remain Canadian.”</h4>					<h5>A Taste of Home in Every Bottle &bull; “It’s Canada in a bottle.”</h5>','Our Story','','inherit','closed','closed','','11-revision-v1','','','2026-11-24 12:12:53','2026-11-24 12:12:53','',11,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1278',0,'revision','',0),(1279,1,'2026-11-24 12:12:54','2026-11-24 12:12:54','<h4>AUTHENTIC CANADIAN HERITAGE</h4>					<h1>Born From Our Family, Born From the Land</h1>							\n				<p>A proudly Canadian brand inspired by our family\'s story, Canada\'s natural beauty, and the genuine kindness of its people.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER ONE &bull; THE 1990s</h5>					<h2>A Simple Word That Stayed With Us</h2>		<p>Our story began in the 1990s, when our father frequently traveled between Canada and the United States for business.</p><p>During his travels, he visited a few small Canadian towns, driving through beautiful forests, quiet country roads, and peaceful communities where people welcomed him with warm smiles and a familiar Canadian expression:</p>			“Beautiful day, eh?”					“Good water, eh?”					“Tastes fresh, eh?”		<p>That simple word, <strong>“Eh!”</strong>, stayed with him. It represented something special about Canada: its friendly people, welcoming communities, and natural beauty.</p><p>One day, while exploring Canada\'s beautiful wilderness, he discovered spring water that tasted exceptionally fresh, clean, and naturally smooth. He described that moment in a few simple words:</p>			<h4>“This is what purity tastes like. This feels like home.”</h4>		<p>That experience inspired a dream: to share the natural freshness of Canadian spring water with people around the world. Years later, our family decided to turn that dream into reality, with one clear mission: <strong>To bring premium Canadian spring water to the world while preserving its natural quality, purity, and character.</strong></p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/canadian_road_journey.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h5>CANADA IN A BOTTLE</h5>					<h3>Pure Canadian Spring Water</h3>		<p>Protected by Canadian government source lands, filtered naturally through mountain rock and ice.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER TWO &bull; PROVEN STANDARDS</h5>					<h2>Quality Proven, Not Just Promised</h2>		<p>A great story is important, but for us, a great story isn\'t enough. Quality must be proven, not just promised. Our quality is supported by rigorous international testing, official documentation, and an unwavering commitment to doing things properly.</p>													<img width=\"1916\" height=\"821\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed.webp 1916w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-300x129.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-1024x439.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-768x329.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-1536x658.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1916px) 100vw, 1916px\" />																<h3>Dubai Government Laboratory Testing (2026)</h3>							\n				<p>In 2026, our Canadian spring water underwent laboratory testing in Dubai, United Arab Emirates, where it successfully passed the required tests.</p><p>The results were documented in official reports issued by a Dubai government laboratory, and those records remain permanently on file as proof of our international standards.</p>													<img width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed.webp 1672w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-300x169.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-1024x576.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-768x432.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-1536x864.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1672px) 100vw, 1672px\" />																<h3>Canadian Testing &amp; Naturally Occurring Minerals</h3>							\n				<p>Our water has passed applicable Canadian testing and regulatory requirements. We continue to test our water periodically as part of our commitment to maintaining consistent quality and safety.</p><p>What makes Canada Eh! special is its natural mineral content: carefully bottled with as little human handling as possible, preserving the calcium, magnesium, and natural qualities that make it unique.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER THREE &bull; GLOBAL REACH</h5>					<h2>From Canada to the World</h2>		<p>Today, Canada Eh! is expanding its presence internationally, bringing premium Canadian spring water to businesses and homes in Dubai and across the UAE, Portugal, and other European markets.</p><p>While our international journey continues to grow, we have taken a more gradual approach in Canada, our home market, focusing on building a strong foundation and lasting relationships.</p><p>We believe that meaningful growth takes time. Our goal has never been simply to sell more bottles, but to build a Canadian brand that people can recognize, trust, and feel proud to support.</p>			<h4>OUR CORE FAMILY VALUES</h4>					<h6>01</h6>					<h4>Purity</h4>		<p>Natural spring water from government-protected Canadian lands, preserved without artificial processing.</p>			<h6>02</h6>					<h4>Respect</h4>		<p>Deep respect for the land, our home communities, and every country where our bottles are sold.</p>			<h6>03</h6>					<h4>Honesty</h4>		<p>Transparency in all we do, backed by verified laboratory documentation and rigorous standards.</p>			<h6>04</h6>					<h4>Quality</h4>		<p>Carefully bottled with minimal human contact, preserving balanced natural calcium and magnesium.</p>			<h6>05</h6>					<h4>And a touch of “Eh!”</h4>		<p>The genuine warmth, hospitality, and welcoming kindness of the Canadian spirit in every single drop.</p>			<h4>“No matter how far our water travels, our roots will always remain Canadian.”</h4>					<h5>A Taste of Home in Every Bottle &bull; “It’s Canada in a bottle.”</h5>','Our Story','','inherit','closed','closed','','11-revision-v1','','','2026-11-24 12:12:54','2026-11-24 12:12:54','',11,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1279',0,'revision','',0),(1280,1,'2026-11-24 12:12:54','2026-11-24 12:12:54','<h4>AUTHENTIC CANADIAN HERITAGE</h4>					<h1>Born From Our Family, Born From the Land</h1>							\n				<p>A proudly Canadian brand inspired by our family\'s story, Canada\'s natural beauty, and the genuine kindness of its people.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER ONE &bull; THE 1990s</h5>					<h2>A Simple Word That Stayed With Us</h2>		<p>Our story began in the 1990s, when our father frequently traveled between Canada and the United States for business.</p><p>During his travels, he visited a few small Canadian towns, driving through beautiful forests, quiet country roads, and peaceful communities where people welcomed him with warm smiles and a familiar Canadian expression:</p>			“Beautiful day, eh?”					“Good water, eh?”					“Tastes fresh, eh?”		<p>That simple word, <strong>“Eh!”</strong>, stayed with him. It represented something special about Canada: its friendly people, welcoming communities, and natural beauty.</p><p>One day, while exploring Canada\'s beautiful wilderness, he discovered spring water that tasted exceptionally fresh, clean, and naturally smooth. He described that moment in a few simple words:</p>			<h4>“This is what purity tastes like. This feels like home.”</h4>		<p>That experience inspired a dream: to share the natural freshness of Canadian spring water with people around the world. Years later, our family decided to turn that dream into reality, with one clear mission: <strong>To bring premium Canadian spring water to the world while preserving its natural quality, purity, and character.</strong></p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/canadian_road_journey.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h5>CANADA IN A BOTTLE</h5>					<h3>Pure Canadian Spring Water</h3>		<p>Protected by Canadian government source lands, filtered naturally through mountain rock and ice.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER TWO &bull; PROVEN STANDARDS</h5>					<h2>Quality Proven, Not Just Promised</h2>		<p>A great story is important, but for us, a great story isn\'t enough. Quality must be proven, not just promised. Our quality is supported by rigorous international testing, official documentation, and an unwavering commitment to doing things properly.</p>													<img width=\"1916\" height=\"821\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed.webp 1916w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-300x129.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-1024x439.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-768x329.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dubai_skyline_no_gradient_compressed-1536x658.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1916px) 100vw, 1916px\" />																<h3>Dubai Government Laboratory Testing (2026)</h3>							\n				<p>In 2026, our Canadian spring water underwent laboratory testing in Dubai, United Arab Emirates, where it successfully passed the required tests.</p><p>The results were documented in official reports issued by a Dubai government laboratory, and those records remain permanently on file as proof of our international standards.</p>													<img width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed.webp 1672w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-300x169.webp 300w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-1024x576.webp 1024w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-768x432.webp 768w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/laboratory_no_gradient_compressed-1536x864.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1672px) 100vw, 1672px\" />																<h3>Canadian Testing &amp; Naturally Occurring Minerals</h3>							\n				<p>Our water has passed applicable Canadian testing and regulatory requirements. We continue to test our water periodically as part of our commitment to maintaining consistent quality and safety.</p><p>What makes Canada Eh! special is its natural mineral content: carefully bottled with as little human handling as possible, preserving the calcium, magnesium, and natural qualities that make it unique.</p>			<h5>CHAPTER THREE &bull; GLOBAL REACH</h5>					<h2>From Canada to the World</h2>		<p>Today, Canada Eh! is expanding its presence internationally, bringing premium Canadian spring water to businesses and homes in Dubai and across the UAE, Portugal, and other European markets.</p><p>While our international journey continues to grow, we have taken a more gradual approach in Canada, our home market, focusing on building a strong foundation and lasting relationships.</p><p>We believe that meaningful growth takes time. Our goal has never been simply to sell more bottles, but to build a Canadian brand that people can recognize, trust, and feel proud to support.</p>			<h4>OUR CORE FAMILY VALUES</h4>					<h6>01</h6>					<h4>Purity</h4>		<p>Natural spring water from government-protected Canadian lands, preserved without artificial processing.</p>			<h6>02</h6>					<h4>Respect</h4>		<p>Deep respect for the land, our home communities, and every country where our bottles are sold.</p>			<h6>03</h6>					<h4>Honesty</h4>		<p>Transparency in all we do, backed by verified laboratory documentation and rigorous standards.</p>			<h6>04</h6>					<h4>Quality</h4>		<p>Carefully bottled with minimal human contact, preserving balanced natural calcium and magnesium.</p>			<h6>05</h6>					<h4>And a touch of “Eh!”</h4>		<p>The genuine warmth, hospitality, and welcoming kindness of the Canadian spirit in every single drop.</p>			<h4>“No matter how far our water travels, our roots will always remain Canadian.”</h4>					<h5>A Taste of Home in Every Bottle &bull; “It’s Canada in a bottle.”</h5>','Our Story','','inherit','closed','closed','','11-revision-v1','','','2026-11-24 12:12:54','2026-11-24 12:12:54','',11,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1280',0,'revision','',0),(1406,1,'2026-11-25 04:40:11','2026-11-25 04:40:11','AUTHENTIC CANADIAN HERITAGE					<h1>Every Drop Reflects the Purity and Beauty of Nature</h1>		<p>Water as nature intended. Naturally occurring minerals, a refreshingly clean taste, and a beautifully balanced character. Canada EH! celebrates the simplicity of water, bringing an exceptional drinking experience to your everyday moments. No unnecessary promises. Just nature, quality, and authentic refreshment.</p>			THE SIGNATURE CHARACTER					<h2>Experience the Difference</h2>		<p>Each bottle of Canada EH! Water represents nature\'s highest standard of purity, refreshing clarity, and balanced hydration.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Naturally occurring mineral composition</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Crisp, clean and refreshing taste</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Smooth and balanced drinking experience</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Inspired by Canada\'s remarkable natural heritage</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Refreshment for every occasion</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>A premium addition to your everyday lifestyle</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>An appreciation for nature and simplicity</h3>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Exceptional quality in every bottle</h3>															<img width=\"887\" height=\"1774\" src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1.png 887w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1-150x300.png 150w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1-512x1024.png 512w, http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Canada-Eh-Signature-Water-Bottle-1-768x1536.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 887px) 100vw, 887px\" />																CANADA EH! WATER					<h3>Pure Canadian Spring Water</h3>		<p>Harvested from protected Canadian spring zones. Pure, balanced, and bottled fresh at source.</p>			ELEVATE YOUR EVERYDAY HYDRATION					<h2>Experience Authentic Canadian Refreshment</h2>		<p>Discover our collection of premium Canadian spring water bottles, crafted for mindful living and refined taste.</p>								<a href=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/products/\">\n									Explore Our Collection\n					</a>','Why It’s Magical Water','','inherit','closed','closed','','13-revision-v1','','','2026-11-25 04:40:11','2026-11-25 04:40:11','',13,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1406',0,'revision','',0),(1369,1,'2026-11-25 04:29:17','2026-11-25 04:29:17','<h4>CANADIAN VALUES &bull; GLOBAL IMPACT</h4>					<h1>Canadian Values. Global Impact.</h1>							\n				<p>At Canada Eh!, we believe in supporting every country where our water is sold, the Canadian way — with kindness, generosity, and care for others.</p><p>Every country has different needs, and we want to make a positive difference in each one.</p><p>Every year, we give back through trusted organizations and proper channels. As our company grows, our support will grow too, helping more people, families, and communities around the world.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/canada_cause.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Canada_Pantone.svg.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h4>Canada (CA)</h4>					<h3>Supporting Our Own Communities</h3>							\n				Canada is our home, and giving back starts here. Every year, we aim to support: Veterans who have served our country; Low-income families struggling with everyday expenses; People experiencing homelessness who need food, shelter, and support; Indigenous Canadians and communities through programs that improve lives and create opportunities.													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/portugal_cause.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Portugal_official.svg.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h4>Portugal (PT)</h4>					<h3>Helping Families and Communities</h3>							\n				<p>We support families in need through food programs, basic necessities, and local community projects. We also help protect Portugal\'s beautiful environment.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/monaco_cause.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Monaco-flag.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h4>Monaco (MC)</h4>					<h3>Protecting the Ocean</h3>							\n				<p>We support projects that keep beaches clean, reduce pollution, and protect marine animals and the Mediterranean Sea.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/luxembourg_cause.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Luxembourg-Flag.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h4>Luxembourg (LU)</h4>					<h3>Supporting Children and Nature</h3>							\n				<p>We help support children\'s health and environmental projects that protect forests and create a healthier future.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/singapore_cause.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_Singapore-1.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h4>Singapore (SG)</h4>					<h3>Creating Opportunities for Young People</h3>							\n				<p>We support education, training, and programs that help young people develop skills and build better futures.</p>													<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/causes_assets/dubai_cause.webp\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																										<img src=\"http://stevencanadaehwater.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Flag_of_the_United_Arab_Emirates.svg.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h4>Dubai (AE)</h4>					<h3>Protecting Beaches and Marine Life</h3>							\n				<p>We support beach cleanups, ocean protection, and projects that reduce plastic waste and keep the Gulf cleaner.</p>			<h4>OUR PROMISE</h4>					<h2>Our Promise — Growing Together, Giving Back Together</h2>							\n				<p>Wherever Canada Eh! is sold, we want to give something back to that country.</p><p>Our goal is simple: Support local communities, respect each country\'s needs, and share the Canadian spirit of kindness around the world. We plan to make contributions annually through trusted organizations and proper channels, with our support expanding as our business grows.</p><p>The more bottles we sell, the more people and communities we can help.</p>			<h4>Canada Eh! — Every Sip Refreshes You. Every Drop Makes a Difference.</h4>','Each Drop Matters','','inherit','closed','closed','','9-revision-v1','','','2026-11-25 04:29:17','2026-11-25 04:29:17','',9,'http://stevencanadaehwater.local/?p=1369',0,'revision','',0),(1452,1,'2026-11-25 05:06:06','2026-11-25 05:06:06','AUTHENTIC CANADIAN HERITAGE					<h1>Every Drop Reflects the Purity and Beauty of Nature</h1>		<p>Water as nature intended. Naturally occurring minerals, a refreshingly clean taste, and a beautifully balanced character. Canada EH! celebrates the simplicity of water, bringing an exceptional drinking experience to your everyday moments. No unnecessary promises. Just nature, quality, and authentic refreshment.</p>			THE SIGNATURE CHARACTER					<h2>Experience the Difference</h2>		<p>Each bottle of Canada EH! Water represents nature\'s highest standard of purity, refreshing clarity, and balanced hydration.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9